{
 "format": "damap",
 "version": 1,
 "id": "66",
 "name": "Shard to Gondola Area",
 "file": "Map66_STR3.xml",
 "rooms": [
  {"id":1,"x":-180,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Prairie","descriptions":["In stark relief to the rolling prairie, a small stand of deep green trees can be seen to the southeast.  Overhead, a hawk cries out, then dives into the tall grasses.  When he emerges moments later, he carries a barely-struggling prairie rat."],"exits":[{"to":12,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":14,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":2,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":2,"x":-180,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Prairie","descriptions":["The taller grasses and flowers give way here to shorter buffalo grass and primroses.  A small flock of prairie-chickens scratch in the dirt and grass for food.  Though they move away from visitors to the area, there is not sufficient danger to send them squawking for shelter.","The taller grasses and flowers give way here to shorter buffalo grass and primroses.  The pale primroses are in full bloom, casting their sweet scent across the prairie."],"exits":[{"to":1,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":4,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":3,"exit":"go","move":"go path"}]},
  {"id":3,"x":-180,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Derelict Road, Whistling Wood","descriptions":["The stone road, once the pinnacle of craftsmanship, is cracked and worn.  Framed on both sides by the Whistling Wood, it winds its way southward to the Dark Hand.  The crumbling remains of the old South Bridge of Shard can be seen to the north, set against the crystalline purity of the city's walls."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":0,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":2,"exit":"go","move":"go path"}],"aliases":["S Gate","sgate"],"linksTo":"Map68_Shard_South_Gate.xml"},
  {"id":4,"x":-200,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Prairie","descriptions":["The path skirts the edge of a slough hole.  The swamp-like depression is filled with cattails, pickerelweed and soft rushes.  A pair of lark sparrows is feeding on the mosquitoes and other insects that are flittering over the slough."],"exits":[{"to":2,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":5,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":5,"x":-220,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Prairie","descriptions":["The path weaves through a thick patch of prairie junegrass.  The sod underfoot feels as solid as a stone road although it's composed of only grass and dirt.  In the taller grasses at the path's edge, there are signs of trails and burrows made by small animals."],"exits":[{"to":4,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":6,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":6,"x":-240,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Prairie","descriptions":["In all directions, as far as the eye can see, stretch gentle rolling hills covered in billowing green and gold waves.  A patch of dark green to the east and some sort of clearing to the far north are the only variations that can be seen from here."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":5,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":7,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":37,"exit":"go","move":"go gap"}]},
  {"id":7,"x":-260,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Prairie","descriptions":["A male grouse, in full peacock-like display, struts proudly back and forth at the far end of the trail.  Suddenly he stops, cups his wings behind him and then begins to slowly beat his wings.  As he picks up the pace, the sound goes from a mute pop to the booming of a kettledrum.  There is a brief rustling in the grass and out pops a hen."],"exits":[{"to":6,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":8,"x":-240,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Prairie","descriptions":["A large field of tall sweet william and big bluestem prairie grass change the billowing waves of grass to lavender and blue-green.  From their hidden vantage nearby, a pair of meadowlarks sings happily.","A large field of tall sweet william and big bluestem prairie grass change the billowing waves of grass to lavender and blue-green.  From a hidden vantage nearby, an owl hoots briefly, then flutters from its hiding place to glide overhead."],"exits":[{"to":9,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":6,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":9,"x":-240,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Prairie","descriptions":["From the top of this small hill, a homestead -- complete with house, barn and fields -- can be seen to the north.  Like an island suddenly appearing in the middle of an otherwise featureless sea, the homestead looks sadly out of place on the prairie.","From the top of this small hill, the vague outlines of several buildings can be seen in a large clearing to the north.  Amid the tall waving grasses, the clearing looks like a wound on the surface of the prairie."],"exits":[{"to":10,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":8,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":10,"x":-240,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Prairie, Old Homestead","descriptions":["A rough split-rail fence marks the start of the homestead.  Parts of the fence, including the gate, have fallen into disrepair.  Beyond the gate, the homestead looks abandoned and forlorn."],"exits":[{"to":9,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":11,"exit":"go","move":"go rough gate"}]},
  {"id":11,"x":-220,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Prairie, Old Homestead","descriptions":["The encroachment of the prairie has been halted for the time being as signs of activity become apparent.  Though the sod house and barn are in ruin, the fresh scent of horse droppings and hoof and foot prints in every direction suggest the homestead is not abandoned."],"exits":[{"to":34,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":30,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":10,"exit":"go","move":"go rough gate"},{"to":35,"exit":"go","move":"go corral"},{"to":36,"exit":"go","move":"go old barn"}]},
  {"id":12,"x":-160,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Prairie, Prairie Dog Town","descriptions":["Cone-shaped piles of dirt, each with an entrance hole, dot a large expanse of land.  After a moment, a prairie dog peeks from one hole then cautiously climbs out.  He looks cautiously around, then lets out a ringing bark and suddenly the area is swarming with other dogs."],"exits":[{"to":1,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":13,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"aliases":["Prairie Dog Town"]},
  {"id":13,"x":-180,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Prairie, Prairie Dog Town","descriptions":["A prairie dog sentinel carefully watches the borders of his town.  Every so often, he flicks his tail and the other dogs in the area pause.  When he gives no additional signals of danger, they continue with their activities.  Some are eating grasses, while others are grooming one another.  A couple are even busy digging a new mound."],"exits":[{"to":12,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":14,"x":-160,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Prairie, Wylder Spring","descriptions":["A large weeping willow hangs over the western end of Wylder Spring.  Beneath it the air is cool and shaded, a welcome respite from the heat of the ever-present prairie sun.  Cattails and shallow water grasses grow around the edge of the pond.","A large weeping willow hangs over the western end of Wylder Spring.  Cattails and shallow water grasses grow around the edge of the pond.  Bullfrogs, hidden in the cattails, croak endlessly through the night."],"exits":[{"to":18,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":15,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":1,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#008000"},
  {"id":15,"x":-140,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Prairie, Wylder Spring","descriptions":["A cloud of gnats swirls along the shore, choking unwary travelers who inhale a lung-full of their almost invisible bodies.  A bullfrog leaps from a waterlily into the spring and submerges, leaving only his eyes and nostrils visible.","A cloud of gnats swirls along the shore, choking unwary travelers who inhale a lung-full of their almost invisible bodies.  As fireflies dance up and down over the surface of the spring, their brief flashes of light are reflected in the water."],"exits":[{"to":16,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":14,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#008000"},
  {"id":16,"x":-120,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Prairie, Wylder Spring","descriptions":["The path passes between several young willows along the shore and a row of cottonwoods that sit farther back.  The air is filled with the white puffball-like seeds of the cottonwood."],"exits":[{"to":17,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":15,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":462,"exit":"climb","move":"climb tall cottonwood"}],"color":"#008000"},
  {"id":17,"x":-100,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Prairie, Wylder Spring","descriptions":["A family of ducks floats calmly on the surface of the spring, weaving through waterlillies and the trailing limbs of a weeping willow near the shore before venturing into the clearer waters in the middle.  To the east, the rolling gold and green of the prairie returns."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":16,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":18,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#008000"},
  {"id":18,"x":-140,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Prairie, Wylder Spring","descriptions":["A startled jackrabbit bounds quickly from the spring into the surrounding prairie grass.  A variety of animal tracks, including some left by the jackrabbit, can be seen in the muddy shoreline."],"exits":[{"to":17,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":14,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#008000"},
  {"id":19,"x":-80,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Prairie","descriptions":["In the distance a small herd of bison grazes among the prairie grasses.  From the tracks in the dirt here, it looks as if they sometimes travel to the spring for water."],"exits":[{"to":20,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":17,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":20,"x":-60,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Haizen Jan Aradan, Prairie","descriptions":["As if announcing the transition to high desert plains, a solitary prophet tree lifts silvery-barked and heavily spiked limbs to the sky.  Its deep scarlet blossoms hang like a benediction over the plains and frame a distant view of the vividly variegated badlands to the east.","A solitary tree lifts its heavily spiked limbs toward the dark heavens.  To the east, hulking shadows rise from the ground."],"exits":[{"to":21,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":19,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":21,"x":-40,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Haizen Jan Aradan, Prairie","descriptions":["The ground slopes downward into a wide, shallow depression to the northeast.  Sparse prairie shortgrass grows along the perimeter, thickening into a lush green field dotted with pink and purple flowers toward the center of the depression.  Beyond the hollow, colorfully striated cliffs rise above the horizon.","The ground slopes downward into a wide, shallow depression to the northeast, where the air seems very still.  Deep shades of night rise beyond the hollow."],"exits":[{"to":28,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":29,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":22,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":20,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":22,"x":20,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Haizen Jan Aradan, Prairie","descriptions":["The ground slopes downward into a wide, shallow depression to the northwest.  Sparse prairie shortgrass grows along the perimeter, thickening into a lush green field dotted with pink and purple flowers toward the center of the depression.  To the northeast, colorfully striated cliffs rise above the horizon.","The ground slopes downward into a wide, shallow depression to the northwest, where the air seems very still.  Deep shades of night rise above the northeastern horizon."],"exits":[{"to":23,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":21,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":29,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":23,"x":40,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Haizen Jan Aradan, Prairie","descriptions":["The ground slopes downward into a wide, shallow depression to the west.  Sparse prairie shortgrass grows along the perimeter, thickening into a lush green field dotted with pink and purple flowers toward the center of the depression.  To the northeast, colorfully striated cliffs rise above the horizon.","The ground slopes downward into a wide, shallow depression to the west, where the air seems very still.  Deep shades of night rise above the northeastern horizon."],"exits":[{"to":22,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":29,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":24,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":24,"x":20,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Haizen Jan Aradan, Prairie","descriptions":["The ground slopes downward into a wide, shallow depression to the southwest.  Sparse prairie shortgrass grows along the perimeter, thickening into a lush green field dotted with pink and purple flowers toward the center of the depression.  To the northeast, colorfully striated cliffs rise above the horizon.","The ground slopes downward into a wide, shallow depression to the southwest, where the air seems very still.  Deep shades of night rise above the northeastern horizon."],"exits":[{"to":25,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":23,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":29,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":27,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":25,"x":40,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Haizen Jan Aradan, Prairie","descriptions":["Colorful buttes formed from tinted layers of soil rise majestically above the expanse of the savannah to the northeast.  To the southwest, the land sinks into a wide shallow depression full of shortgrass punctuated by pink and purple flowers.","Dark, shadowy buttes rise intimidatingly above the flat expanse of the savannah to the northeast.  To the southwest, the land sinks into a wide shallow depression."],"exits":[{"to":26,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":24,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":26,"x":60,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Haizen Jan Aradan, Prairie","descriptions":["The distinctively colored plateaus of the Mosaic Bluffs rise above the northern horizon.  Massive columns tower over the surrounding prairie and slender spires arch in fantastic shapes.","To the north, dark mesas rise above the flat horizon of the grasslands.  Only the occasional chirping of crickets and the swish of grasses waving in the breeze break the quiet evening solitude."],"exits":[{"to":25,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":488,"exit":"climb","move":"climb steep trail"}]},
  {"id":27,"x":-20,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Haizen Jan Aradan, Prairie","descriptions":["The ground slopes downward into a wide, shallow depression to the southeast.  Sparse prairie shortgrass grows along the perimeter, thickening into a lush green field dotted with pink and purple flowers toward the center of the depression.  To the northeast, colorfully striated cliffs rise above the horizon.","The ground slopes downward into a wide, shallow depression to the southeast, where the air seems very still.  Deep shades of night rise above the northeastern horizon."],"exits":[{"to":24,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":29,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":28,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":28,"x":-40,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Haizen Jan Aradan, Prairie","descriptions":["The ground slopes downward into a wide, shallow depression to the east.  Sparse prairie shortgrass grows along the perimeter, thickening into a lush green field dotted with pink and purple flowers toward the center of the depression.  To the northeast, colorfully striated cliffs rise above the horizon.","The ground slopes downward into a wide, shallow depression to the east, where the air seems very still.  Deep shades of night rise above the northeastern horizon."],"exits":[{"to":27,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":29,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":21,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":29,"x":0,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Haizen Jan Aradan, Prairie","descriptions":["At the center of this broad, shallow crater the earth is alive with lush green prairie shortgrass brightened by tiny pink and purple sweet vetch blossoms.","The prairie shortgrass grows thick at the center of this broad, shallow crater.  Protected from night breezes by the slight surrounding rise, the air is calm and quiet."],"exits":[{"to":24,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":23,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":22,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":21,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":28,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":27,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":30,"x":-240,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Prairie, Old Homestead","descriptions":["Vaguely straight rows of ripening wheat wave gently in the wind.  In the shaded furrows between, blue bells, goldenrods, and oxeye daisies grow happily."],"exits":[{"to":11,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":31,"exit":"go","move":"go trampled path"}]},
  {"id":31,"x":-280,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Prairie, A Large Clearing","descriptions":["Looming overhead, a wayward pine tree spreads heavy branches over this verdant clearing, its benevolent presence offering a fragrant shelter from the elements.  Weaving across the area is a narrow path that leads to a neat cottage veiled with goldenbell vines, the doorway framed by clay planters clustered with flowers and herbs."],"exits":[{"to":32,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":30,"exit":"go","move":"go trampled path"},{"to":233,"exit":"go","move":"go ivy-veiled cottage"},{"to":232,"exit":"go","move":"go pine tree"}]},
  {"id":32,"x":-260,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Prairie, Secluded Building","descriptions":["Weathered to the soft gold hues of its surroundings, a wood-framed building stands behind a screen of graceful bluestem and plumegrasses.  The stately prairie denizens dapple the building with a mosaic of moving shadows.  To the southwest is the towering silhouette of a wayward pine tree, almost obscuring the cottage tucked against its base."],"exits":[{"to":31,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":33,"exit":"go","move":"go pine tree"},{"to":231,"exit":"go","move":"go wood-framed building"}]},
  {"id":33,"x":-260,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Survivalist Supplies, Back Room","descriptions":["Fragrant pine boughs hang to the ground, sheltering this quiet space from the elements.  Flickering light from a fire crackling in a stone-lined pit sends dancing reflections against the forest-green curtain that divides the trunk into a cozy semicircle.  A case sits below a shelf that has been affixed so carefully that the tree trunk is growing unharmed around it."],"exits":[{"to":32,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":232,"exit":"go","move":"go green curtain"}],"color":"#FF0000"},
  {"id":34,"x":-220,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Prairie, Old Homestead","descriptions":["Pumpkin vines compete with the prairie grasses for dominance of an old vegetable and herb garden.  Carrot tops, dillweed and even some sunflower plants poke out here and there.  Among the vines, open holes in the soil reveal that someone has reaped what was sown long ago."],"exits":[{"to":11,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":35,"x":-220,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Prairie, Corral","descriptions":["Small piles of fodder upon the ground, the remains of a recent meal, suggest that someone has recently found a use for the dilapidated corral.  The rest of the split-rail corral lies in ruin, with only a few standing posts remaining, making it hard to determine where the prairie stops and the structure begins."],"exits":[{"to":11,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":36,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":36,"x":-200,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Prairie, Old Homestead","descriptions":["The dark, damp barn is little more than a large shed divided into two stalls.  Newly cut hay is stored in one of the stalls, while in the other a bedroll has been neatly stretched out.  More than mice now inhabit what was once an empty, echoing structure."],"exits":[{"to":35,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":11,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":37,"x":-300,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Abandoned Road","descriptions":["Several long-abandoned crates sit on the side of the road.  Some have cracked open, spilling their contents -- rusted unmarked tins, long-decayed pelts, sacks of putrid half-sprouted grains and seeds. The wind must have picked up some of the grains before they sprouted because a wide band of wheat, barley and oats grows in a widening arc from the crates."],"exits":[{"to":38,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":39,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":6,"exit":"go","move":"go gap"}]},
  {"id":38,"x":-270,"y":130,"z":0,"title":"Abandoned Road","descriptions":["The old road ends in a wide meadow.  A flock of sheep is grazing while a shepherd boy looks on.  Suddenly there is a bark and bleat, followed by a ewe and lamb breaking out of the taller grasses at the meadow's edge.  A sheep dog comes trotting out after them, quite proud of his find.","The old road ends in a wide meadow.  A shepherd sits before a fire while another one sleeps nearby.  Their flock looks like white cotton scattered around the clearing.  A pair of sheep dogs silently patrols the perimeter, guarding their charges from the night predators."],"exits":[{"to":37,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":636,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden gate"}]},
  {"id":39,"x":-340,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Abandoned Road","descriptions":["Clumps of grass and flowers dot the surface of an old gravel road.  The prairie grasses on either side are slowly creeping in, and in a few years will have obscured the road completely.  Every now and again, the wind carries the muted city noises from Shard, but otherwise all that can be heard is an almost silent rush of the wind through the grass.","Clumps of brush and flowers dot the surface of an old gravel road.  The prairie grasses on either side are slowly creeping in, and in a few years will have obscured the road completely.  There is a dim glow to the west from the lights of Shard."],"exits":[{"to":45,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":37,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":40,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":40,"x":-360,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"East Trade Route, Journey's Rest","descriptions":["For centuries, the Journey's Rest has been a stopping point for travelers arriving to and leaving from the fabled city of Shard.  Marble benches provide a place to rest weary feet and chat with passing merchants or wanderers.  To the east lies an expanse of farm fields stretching as far as the naked eye can see."],"exits":[{"to":39,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":41,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":41,"x":-380,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Shard, East Bridge","descriptions":["Marble balustrades on either side of the walkway shine with a mysterious light of their own, marking the boundaries of the bridge's width.  The ancient planks underfoot are hard and sturdy, defying the erosion of time."],"exits":[{"to":40,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":42,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":42,"x":-400,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Shard, East Bridge","descriptions":["Here the bridge rises to its highest point, affording a view of the tremendous expanse of farmlands east of the lake.  To the west the Tower of Shard rises majestically over the walls of the city."],"exits":[{"to":41,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":43,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":43,"x":-420,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Shard, East Bridge","descriptions":["Directly west, Shard's east gate stands sentinel over traffic crossing into and out of the city.  To the east, the bridge arcs to the shore of the Lake of Tears.  Years of caravan traffic has left its mark in the planking of this otherwise well-maintained structure."],"exits":[{"to":42,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":44,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":44,"x":-440,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Shard, East Bridge","descriptions":["The extravagance of the eastern quarter of Shard is evident here milk-white marble railings gleam on the cloudiest days.  The marble and the life-sculpted deobar supports show that no expense was spared in olden times, and the new paving stones that cover the roadway blend unobtrusively with the old construction.","The extravagance of the eastern quarter of Shard is evident here; milk-white marble railings gleam on the cloudiest days.  The marble and the life-sculpted deobar supports show that no expense was spared in olden times, and the new paving stones that cover the roadway blend unobtrusively with the old construction."],"exits":[{"to":43,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":216,"exit":"go","move":"go city gate"},{"to":618,"exit":"go","move":"go meeting portal"}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["East Bridge","E Bridge","Premium Portal","Portal","Kraelyst start point","travel start point"]},
  {"id":45,"x":-340,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Eastern Lakeside, Small Path","descriptions":["To the southwest, a sloped bridge leads over the water of the Lake of Tears and into the crystal-walled city of Shard.  A small dell filled with bright, bold flowers lines the road that leads out of the eastern wall.  The way curves around the Lake of Tears to the north and west."],"exits":[{"to":46,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":39,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":46,"x":-340,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Eastern Lakeside, Small Path","descriptions":["The lonely road meanders northwest, a tall crystal gate to the south and west welcoming travelers heading for the great city.  Copperleaf trees are planted alongside the path, metallic leaves glittering as sunlight brushes over their scintillating surfaces.  They tinkle softly in the breeze, their cadence the living rhythm of nature's percussion.","Copperleaf trees bow their heads in nightly prayers, their metallic leaves pattering against each other with the languid rhythms of a lazy storm.  The lakeside ripples, its surface dark with the tide of evening."],"exits":[{"to":47,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":45,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":47,"x":-340,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Eastern Lakeside, Small Path","descriptions":["Bushes bearing pale snowflower blossoms cluster at the water's edge.  A tall willow tree sways gently in the breeze, its long, fine branches dipping down into the water.","The night sky frames the slender form of a willow tree.  Her countenance, though rugged, bears all the regal grace of a queen, her form rising against the sweeping scape of the lake, proud and graceful beneath the stars."],"exits":[{"to":48,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":46,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":256,"exit":"go","move":"go winding trail"}],"aliases":["food cart"]},
  {"id":48,"x":-340,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Eastern Shore, Road by the Gate","descriptions":["Tall stalks of hyacinthe and delicate clementine blossoms perfume the air.  The wind blows a cool comforting breeze over the water of the lake, calming and soothing the weary traveler.","Tall stalks of nightflower and jes-rose blossoms perfume the air.  The wind blows a cool, comforting breeze over the water of the lake, calming and soothing the weary traveler."],"exits":[{"to":49,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":47,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":49,"x":-340,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Eastern Shore, Road by the Gate","descriptions":["The gates of Shard to the south glimmer with refracted colors and hues.  The shimmering water of the lake ripples and glistens beneath the glowing city, framing the great capital of Ilithi in an aura of pure light."],"exits":[{"to":50,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":48,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":50,"x":-340,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Northern Lakeside, East Gate Road","descriptions":["The road bordering the city is wide and clean, bringing the orderliness of the Elothean people to even the most humble of places.  Delicate crystal flowers twine around dark metal stalks in a roadside garden glistening beneath the sun.","Crystal flowers, obviously lifesculpted, reach their glowing, diamond-like petals to the dark sky.  Grey mist settles around them, edging in from the expansive shore of the lake."],"exits":[{"to":51,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":49,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":51,"x":-340,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Northern Lakeside, East Gate Road","descriptions":["Trader and adventurer alike pass to and from the crystal city along this lakeside path, pausing occasionally to inhale the clean pure air.","Traders and adventurers wander southeast toward the slumbering city, or west to the expanse of the southern road.  The water of the lake ripples tranquilly beneath the night sky."],"exits":[{"to":52,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":50,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":52,"x":-340,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Northern Lake Shore, East Gate Road","descriptions":["The edge of the lake laps against a shore of fine crystal-white sands.  Small wood-violets and sirese flowers lie scattered about the edges of the road, adding splashes of brightness along the dreary route."],"exits":[{"to":51,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":53,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"aliases":["Sirese"]},
  {"id":53,"x":-380,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Northern Lake Shore, East Gate Road","descriptions":["A wrought-iron bridge painted a bright white color twines and spirals in ornate geometric patterns as it arches silently over a small stream and towards a two-story stone mansion set in a nearby grassy field.  Running parallel to the lake, the little creek vanishes swiftly into the forest bordering the path.  The fine Elothean work of the bridge is complimented by a vine brimming with blood-red iera flowers, its petals glistening with moisture."],"exits":[{"to":52,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":54,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":235,"exit":"go","move":"go wrought-iron bridge"}]},
  {"id":54,"x":-400,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"Northern Lake Shore, East Gate Road","descriptions":["Willow trees tremble at the edge of the road, their slender branches wavering in the tremulous breeze that drifts past.  Initials worn past reading are carved on one of the ageless trunks, the letters long forgotten to time and to rain that has slowly eroded their meaning away."],"exits":[{"to":53,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":55,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":55,"x":-420,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Northern Lake Shore, Seeing Stones","descriptions":["A circle of the fabled Elothean Seeing Stones stand tall here.  Obelisks of some luminous obsidian-like rock, they stand in a perfect ring, their tips rising high near the roadside.","The evening sky drapes her cloak over a circle of tall stone obelisks that stand by the roadside.  Aligned with certain heavenly forms above, they stand tall and proud amidst the night's shadows."],"exits":[{"to":54,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":56,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":56,"x":-440,"y":-260,"z":0,"title":"Northern Lakeside, Small Garden","descriptions":["To the east, the tall, slender forms of some black stones peek over a wicker garden fence that neatly edges in the path, a touch of order in this small pocket of wilderness.  A tall wrought-iron arch spirals over the East Gate Road, blooming roses twined around the dark metal.  The heady scent of flowers perfumes the air.","To the east, something black and slender peeks over a wicker garden fence that neatly edges in the path, a touch of order in this small pocket of wilderness.  A tall wrought-iron arch spirals over the East Gate Road, the roses that twine around the dark metal closed for the evening.  The vaguest remnant of their perfume lingers in the air, the scent slowly being erased by the hand of the lakeside breeze."],"exits":[{"to":55,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":57,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":57,"x":-460,"y":-280,"z":0,"title":"Northern Lakeside, Crystal Shore","descriptions":["The fine sands of the shore glisten in the sun.  Thousands of crystal fragments refract light, the beach alongside the road a shimmering skin that carpets the dust from travel and commerce.","Moonlight washes over the pearlescent sands of the lake, their colors and hues shadowed and complimented by the indigo sky."],"exits":[{"to":56,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":58,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":555,"exit":"go","move":"go gravel pathway"}]},
  {"id":58,"x":-480,"y":-300,"z":0,"title":"Northern Lakeside, Eastern Shore","descriptions":["A delicate lily bends over with the weight of dew and small grains of sand on its silken petals.  Golden pollen drifts in the air, a heady scent that mingles with the crispness of the water nearby."],"exits":[{"to":57,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":59,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":59,"x":-540,"y":-300,"z":0,"title":"Northern Lakeside, Willow Grove","descriptions":["The willow trees stand tall and wave their soft branches.  Bright orange blossoms cling to the bark on delicate vines.","The dark clamour of evening's music rings out over Ilithi.   Here in the quiet willow grove it seems the loudest.  The branches of the trees sway and caper in the breeze, their rustling leaves singing a sweet accompaniment."],"exits":[{"to":58,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":60,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":60,"x":-560,"y":-300,"z":0,"title":"Westside Lakeshore, East Gate Road","descriptions":["An ornate silver sign points to the east, indicating the direction where one of the city's gates stands.  The roadside cups the lake's edge, curving protectively around the shore."],"exits":[{"to":59,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":61,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":61,"x":-580,"y":-300,"z":0,"title":"Westside Lakeshore, East Gate Road","descriptions":["The still waters beyond the shore shimmer, their surface sparkling like a ripple of liquid glass as winds brush over the skin of the lake.  To the west the busy Southern Trade Route winds its way to the north edge of the crystal city.  Southeast, the far east gate of Shard devours the end of the path."],"exits":[{"to":60,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":62,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":62,"x":-600,"y":-300,"z":0,"title":"Lake of Tears, East Gate Road","descriptions":["The sparkling metropolis of Shard towers from its perch on the lake, a crystal jewel set into the vibrant crown of the water.  Tall, colorless spires cast shadows over the ground, sunlight streaking against the fantastic city and refracting around the multitude of buildings as a faint aura of glistening rainbows.","Crystal buildings and pinnacles loom over the wall that surrounds Shard, their faceted faces reflected in the dark water below.  Stars twinkle with a soft abandon, their smiling points glittering alongside the tall spires of Shard that stand resolutely over the lake."],"exits":[{"to":61,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":63,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":63,"x":-620,"y":-300,"z":0,"title":"Lake of Tears, East Gate Road","descriptions":["The expansive body of water that Shard is constructed over ripples as a slight breeze brushes over the lake, the cool calmness radiating from the serene blue surface almost hypnotic.","The expansive body of water that Shard is constructed over ripples as a slight breeze brushes over the lake, the cool calmness radiating from the serene cobalt surface almost hypnotic."],"exits":[{"to":62,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":64,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#C2B280","aliases":["RTI03","RT-S-GPS"]},
  {"id":64,"x":-640,"y":-300,"z":0,"title":"Lake of Tears, East Gate Road","descriptions":["This part of the path branches around the shimmering lakeside that encircles the crystal city.  To the southeast, the far gate of Shard lies open for trade and for commerce."],"exits":[{"to":63,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":65,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":65,"x":-660,"y":-300,"z":0,"title":"Southern Trade Route, Road to Shard","descriptions":["Wyvern Mountain towers far into the sky to the southwest, a monument to time and myth.  East of it reclines Shard, a shimmer of light against the omnipresent darkness of the glowering peak."],"exits":[{"to":71,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":64,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":66,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":217,"exit":"go","move":"go muddy trail"}]},
  {"id":66,"x":-660,"y":-280,"z":0,"title":"South Trade Route, Journey's Rest","descriptions":["The Southern Trade Route meets Shard's North Bridge here at the Journey's Rest.  Travelers often use this convenient stopping point to recheck their gear before moving on."],"exits":[{"to":65,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":67,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":617,"exit":"go","move":"go hidden trail"}]},
  {"id":67,"x":-660,"y":-260,"z":0,"title":"Shard, North Bridge","descriptions":["North Bridge gently slopes down towards the shore where it joins the Southern Trade Route connecting Shard to the Northlands."],"exits":[{"to":66,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":68,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":68,"x":-660,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Shard, North Bridge","descriptions":["The Tower of Shard stabs upward over the city walls directly south, accompanied by a smaller, darker tower masked in its own gloom.  To the north a vast field leads up to the edge of the Dragon's Breath Forest."],"exits":[{"to":67,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":69,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":69,"x":-660,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"Shard, North Bridge","descriptions":["The elegance of Elven architecture spills over onto the north bridge from the city proper as evident in the crystal inlay and carefully carved wooden trestles.  The wooden planks and marble supports do not show any indications of time's passage."],"exits":[{"to":68,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":70,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":70,"x":-660,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Shard, North Bridge","descriptions":["To the north of this opulent bridge, the Dragon Spine Mountains span the horizon and exhale a dense forest known simply as the Dragon's Breath.  The North city gates stand close by, guarded by sharp-eyed soldiers on the city wall."],"exits":[{"to":69,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":215,"exit":"go","move":"go city gate"}],"color":"#808000","aliases":["North Bridge","N Bridge","Kraelyst start point","travel start point"]},
  {"id":71,"x":-640,"y":-320,"z":0,"title":"Southern Trade Route, Road to Shard","descriptions":["The well-tended trade route bears signs of both old and recent travel, from scraps of worn leather and clothing tossed aside, to an ancient waystation standing beside the path, as it most likely has for countless years."],"exits":[{"to":65,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":72,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":495,"exit":"go","move":"go ancient waystation"}]},
  {"id":72,"x":-660,"y":-340,"z":0,"title":"Southern Trade Route, Road to Shard","descriptions":["Swarms of people head both south and north along the road.  Dignitaries, Traders, peasants, mages - people from all walks of life traverse the road to and from Shard, a panoply of cultural richness."],"exits":[{"to":71,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":73,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":73,"x":-680,"y":-360,"z":0,"title":"Southern Trade Route, Road to Shard","descriptions":["Elegant rosewood trees line the roadside, their pale red leaves rustling as they slowly drift to the ground.  To the south, the tips of a crystal city peek into view."],"exits":[{"to":74,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":72,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#C2B280","aliases":["RTI04","RT-S-HC"]},
  {"id":74,"x":-680,"y":-380,"z":0,"title":"Southern Trade Route, Road to Shard","descriptions":["The golden farmlands to the north shimmer with fiery ripples as the wind dances over them.  To the south, the road widens, showing signs of frequent trade and use.  An abandoned wagon rests forlornly on a patch of grass near the roadside, a Trader's dream shattered by a broken wheel.","The evening winds languidly glide in from the northern farmlands and over the dusky road.  Shadows cast eerie figures over a broken wagon resting on a patch of grass to one side of the route."],"exits":[{"to":75,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":73,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":75,"x":-680,"y":-400,"z":0,"title":"Golden Grain Fields, Main Road","descriptions":["The fields to the south begin to thin, accomodating for the road as it widens for increasing travel.  On the horizon in the same direction, a shimmering crystal city waits astride a sparkling blue lake.  On the other, northern horizon, the shadows of dark mountains loom hungrily over the fields that languish below them.","The dusk of evening's cloak lingers over the edge of the golden fields to the north and the expansive road leading to Shard in the south.  Starlight glistens, boldly highlighting the crystal metropolis in all her glory on the distant horizon."],"exits":[{"to":76,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":74,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":683,"exit":"go","move":"go winding path"},{"to":683,"exit":"go","move":"go path"}]},
  {"id":76,"x":-660,"y":-400,"z":0,"title":"Golden Grain Fields, Dusky Path","descriptions":["A small chipmunk lounges on a cracked wooden fence, happily munching on the fruit of some poor farmer's hard labors.  The shadow of a homesteading lurks over the rippling fields of grain to the west.","A small black chipmunk lounges on a cracked wooden fence, its eyes shut in repose.  The shadow of a homesteading lurks over the rippling sheafs of grain to the west, its windows glowing with golden firelight."],"exits":[{"to":77,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":75,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":77,"x":-640,"y":-400,"z":0,"title":"Golden Grain Fields, Dusky Path","descriptions":["The fields that surround the road seem to stretch on forever, bright burnished wheat swaying gently to the cadence of a slight breeze.  The wide expanse of sky stretches far over the shimmering grains of the farmland.","The fields that surround the road seem to go on forever, a ripple of varying graytones swaying in a night breeze.  The wide expanse of night curves over the slumbering farmland like the stretched skin of some massive, darkling creature."],"exits":[{"to":78,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":76,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":78,"x":-620,"y":-420,"z":0,"title":"Golden Grain Fields, The Well","descriptions":["A stone well rises from the earth beside the road, its rock surface polished, the rope and gears in prime condition.  A young Elothean girl struggles with a heavy bucket of water, smiling at you through her disheveled golden locks.","The night sky drapes its silken folds over a stone well.  An Elothean girl settles an empty bucket on its rim, readying it to draw water for the evening meal."],"exits":[{"to":79,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":77,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":79,"x":-600,"y":-420,"z":0,"title":"Golden Grain Fields","descriptions":["Workers swing long, sharp scythes back and forth, slicing through the dense gold of the fields.  Swift hands bundle the shafts of grain, laying them aside in tall piles.","Half-cut fields of wheat create a jagged wall to the east and west of the path.  Bundled grains and rolls of hay lie forgotten beside the path, their burden too heavy to be concerned with the notion of theft."],"exits":[{"to":80,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":78,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":80,"x":-580,"y":-420,"z":0,"title":"Edge of the Fields, Dusky Path","descriptions":["An ocean of golden wheat stretches as far as the eye can see.  Wooden yokes and leather harness rest over a weathered oak fence, shiny from use.  Footprints left by meandering livestock are impressed into the soft, fallow earth below."],"exits":[{"to":81,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":79,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":221,"exit":"climb","move":"climb low stile"}]},
  {"id":81,"x":-580,"y":-440,"z":0,"title":"Edge of the Fields, Dusky Path","descriptions":["A dusky path leads south, deeper into the fields, and north towards the forest.  The tip of Wyvern Mountain peeks over the abundant grains, as do the tall spires of Shard in the distance."],"exits":[{"to":109,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":80,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":82,"exit":"go","move":"go bridle path"}]},
  {"id":82,"x":-600,"y":-440,"z":0,"title":"Farmland, Bridle Path","descriptions":["Packed by the passage of foot-sore travelers and trader caravans, the rich loamy soil forms a smooth dark surface.  Undulating across the horizon, the open grassland is broken only by a thin line of trees atop a small rise.  The path splits itself here, sending a narrow ribbon of dirt twisting to the northeast while turning itself westward."],"exits":[{"to":83,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":90,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":81,"exit":"go","move":"go dusky path"}]},
  {"id":83,"x":-580,"y":-460,"z":0,"title":"Farmland, Bridle Path","descriptions":["The wooden palisade of Steelclaw Clan rises to intimidating heights, the only break in its uniformity the gateway to the southwest.  The dirt path winds around the wall, although portions of the soft earth have broken away and fallen into the trench surrounding the palisade."],"exits":[{"to":84,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":82,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":84,"x":-580,"y":-520,"z":0,"title":"Farmland, Bridle Path","descriptions":["The sturdy palisade wall to the west rises high above, the sharpened tips of the logs used to build the wall pointing at the sky like a line of sentry spears raised in defense.  Filled with trash and refuse, the trench continues its way around the wooden wall."],"exits":[{"to":83,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":85,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":85,"x":-600,"y":-540,"z":0,"title":"Farmland, Bridle Path","descriptions":["To the south, the palisade wall of Steelclaw Clan rises intimidatingly into the air, its wooden surface pocked with shadows.  The packed dirt of the path is soft in spots, as though the road were being eaten away from below."],"exits":[{"to":86,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":84,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":86,"x":-600,"y":-560,"z":0,"title":"Farmland, Bridle Path","descriptions":["Large fields, filled with a great variety of crops, lie spread out in the meadow beside the dirt path.  A few figures can be seen in the distance walking through the fields, although it is impossible to say if they are farmers looking over their crops, or young lovers looking for some time alone."],"exits":[{"to":87,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":85,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":87,"x":-580,"y":-580,"z":0,"title":"Farmland, Bridle Path","descriptions":["Farmland stretches from horizon to horizon, creating a panoramic view of harmony with nature.  Being smart farmers, the people of Steelclaw clan have kept the majority of their fields fallow, to regain nutrients for the next planting season.  To the north, a low line of trees can be seen."],"exits":[{"to":88,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":86,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":88,"x":-560,"y":-600,"z":0,"title":"Farmland, Bridle Path","descriptions":["Some devout farmer has erected a shrine to Berengaria, goddess of the growing earth, beside the packed-earth trail.  Although it may just be wishful thinking, the crops growing in the fields adjacent to the shrine seem healthier than those farther away.  The line of trees to the north looms imposingly over the fields."],"exits":[{"to":89,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":87,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#A6A3D9","aliases":["Berengaria","shrine"]},
  {"id":89,"x":-540,"y":-620,"z":0,"title":"Farmland, Bridle Path","descriptions":["The farmlands end abruptly at a line of trees, the demarcation of an old skyfruit orchard.  Those fields abutting the trees are scraggly and look as though they yield little come harvest time.  Skyfruit trees, while producing glorious, highly desired fruit, are notorious for stealing all the nutrients from the soil and requiring long, loving care for the fields to recover."],"exits":[{"to":88,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":90,"x":-760,"y":-440,"z":0,"title":"Steelclaw Clan, Entrance","descriptions":["A forbidding curtain of wood, formed of thick oak logs banded with iron, thrusts itself from the landscape.  At the foot of the palisade, encircling it like a belt to trews, lies a steep-sided trench spanned by the narrow flying bridge that provides the only visible access into the Clan."],"exits":[{"to":82,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":91,"exit":"go","move":"go flying bridge"}],"aliases":["Steelclaw Clan"]},
  {"id":91,"x":-780,"y":-480,"z":0,"title":"Steelclaw Clan, Bailey","descriptions":["Passing between the mammoth beams that serve as gateposts, the bridge discharges its passengers in a neatly kept cobblestone-and-dirt courtyard.  Scores of brightly roofed buildings ring the bowl-shapped bailey and offer a cheerful contrast to the massive hill and great hall rising in the distance.","Passing between the mammoth beams that serve as gateposts, the bridge discharges its passengers in a cobbled courtyard.  Torches on the surrounding walls light the bowl-shapped bailey as grooms and ostlers go about their night-time chores."],"exits":[{"to":94,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":92,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":90,"exit":"go","move":"go palisade gate"}]},
  {"id":92,"x":-800,"y":-500,"z":0,"title":"Steelclaw Clan, Bailey","descriptions":["Dust devils swirl briefly in the wind before settling back to coat the ragged grass lining the thin path running at the base of the palisade.  Overhead, the walkway that runs along the top of the protective walls reverberates with the watchful pacing of the guards."],"exits":[{"to":93,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":91,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":561,"exit":"go","move":"go kirm morzindu"}]},
  {"id":93,"x":-800,"y":-520,"z":0,"title":"Steelclaw Clan, Bailey","descriptions":["Heaps of rusting metal, piles of broken poles and mounds of indistinguishable debris vie against each other for control of this forlorn dark corner of the bailey.  Wobbling precariously, each pile resembles a block of ice on a hot day as the topmost junk trickles down to become the bottommost junk in a continuous cascade of clinks, clanks and clatters."],"exits":[{"to":92,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":202,"exit":"go","move":"go dark corner"}]},
  {"id":94,"x":-760,"y":-480,"z":0,"title":"Steelclaw Clan, Rothan Square","descriptions":["Nestled under the watchful gaze of the palisade lies a large open bailey dotted with neatly whitewashed wood and stone buildings.  Wisps of woodsmoke curl through the air before moving on to mingle with the spicy, sweet and earthy fragrances of a busy community and the raucous clang of metal striking metal, a farrier or weaponsmith at work, harmonizes with the shouted curses of traders chivvying recalcitrant yaks.","Silent and forlorn, the small area of merchant carts and artisan shops has been transformed from a place of comfortable familiarity into a surreal and forbidding landscape held captive by night's velvet grasp.  Faint glimmers of light can be spotted across the bailey and the measured patterns sliced into the darkness as they move reveals they must be the shuttered lanterns carried by Clan journeymen on watch."],"exits":[{"to":98,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":95,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":91,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":95,"x":-700,"y":-480,"z":0,"title":"Steelclaw Clan, Jainder's Stone","descriptions":["Rising upwards like a victorious fist, a thick slab of basalt towers over the neighboring shops and homes.  Rather than removing the obstacle, the bailey folk have simply paved around the black bulk and small benches and tables have been placed around its circumference.  Bundles of flowers and herbs, in various states of decay, are scattered amongst the tables and at the base of the stone."],"exits":[{"to":96,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":94,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":97,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":96,"x":-680,"y":-500,"z":0,"title":"Steelclaw Clan, Telo Jegu","descriptions":["Meandering around the trunk of an ironwood tree, the cobblestone path exhausts itself at the edge of a spacious square where two of the palisade walls join together.  Nestled against the timber lies a series of stone buildings and sheds surrounding a large earthen circle fenced with painted rails.  Inside the fence, hard-eyed men and women raise puffs of dust as they spar against one another or stand alone, swinging gleaming weapons through intricate patterns."],"exits":[{"to":95,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":213,"exit":"go","move":"go stone building"}]},
  {"id":97,"x":-720,"y":-500,"z":0,"title":"Steelclaw Clan, Zindu","descriptions":["Slim wooden homes, shutters painted in bright, crisp colors, invite strollers to admire the herb and flower gardens decorating their front paths.  Jutting from the facade of each residence and overhanging the street, enclosed balconies painted with family crests offer cozy perches for suitors to woo dowered daughters."],"exits":[{"to":95,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":539,"exit":"go","move":"go side street"}]},
  {"id":98,"x":-760,"y":-500,"z":0,"title":"Steelclaw Clan, Jainder's Way","descriptions":["A balky mule pulls a trader's colorful caravan up to the small stone building housing the Trader's outpost.  An apprentice runs out the tiled entrance to hold the lead on the caravan, soothing the mule with her gentle touch, while others work quickly to unload the goods delivered as the master trader passes through the tiled entrance to present his contracts to the clerks within."],"exits":[{"to":99,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":94,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":548,"exit":"go","move":"go tiled entrance"}]},
  {"id":99,"x":-760,"y":-560,"z":0,"title":"Steelclaw Clan, Cistern","descriptions":["Children scamper unfettered about the perimeter of the bailey's water supply, dodging knots of merchants discussing the latest shipments of trader goods, or sit quietly at the feet of scarred veterans listening raptly to tales of long ago battles and blood long since shed.  Young men and women, ladling water into round earthenware jars, exchange flirtatious banter and shy glances in a dance older than civilization as bystanders yell out encouragment from the open doorway of large wooden building.","Though the touch of night's dark cloak has emptied the normally thronging plaza, a blaze of light and noise from the doorway of the Broken Blade falls across the cistern's waters."],"exits":[{"to":101,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":100,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":98,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":207,"exit":"go","move":"go doorway"}],"aliases":["Cistern"]},
  {"id":100,"x":-740,"y":-580,"z":0,"title":"Steelclaw Clan, Alcove","descriptions":["The cobblestoned streets peter out, leaving a packed-earth trail that leads to a dead-end not far from the cistern.  The rhythmic hammering of a forge echoes through the open door of a simple stone building to the right.  A large sign hangs above the doorway, the words carved on it somewhat worn from weather."],"exits":[{"to":99,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":212,"exit":"go","move":"go open door"}]},
  {"id":101,"x":-760,"y":-600,"z":0,"title":"Steelclaw Clan, Jainder's Way","descriptions":["Small shacks and a rough stone stable, weathered a dull grey, crowd against one another with an almost furtive air, as if shrinking from the solid bulk of the motte that rises behind them.  Only the stone avenue appears resolute, continuing its journey towards the heart of the Clan - the massive great hall that crouches atop the summit of the hill."],"exits":[{"to":103,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":102,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":99,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":549,"exit":"go","move":"go weathered stable"}]},
  {"id":102,"x":-740,"y":-600,"z":0,"title":"Steelclaw Clan, Havor Way","descriptions":["Filling the air with a subtle fragrance, a climbing rose drapes its brilliant mantle across a lattice frame, dripping splashes of color across the silver-grey flagstones that lead beneath an intricately carved rosewood arch."],"exits":[{"to":101,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":107,"exit":"go","move":"go rosewood arch"}]},
  {"id":103,"x":-760,"y":-620,"z":0,"title":"Steelclaw Clan, Jainder's Walk","descriptions":["Massive ironwood timbers creak as the cobblestoned street gives way to the broad wooden ramp leading up to the Lamentine bridge.  Swallows, their nests safely tucked up under the bridge supports, dart gracefully hither and fro around the beams and out across the walls to the rich farm lands and dinner.","Stark blackness lines the ramp and bridge supports in odd shadows and shapes and the area is still as it slumbers.  An occasional soft chirring can be heard as the swallows that nest under the bridge question the presence of all comers."],"exits":[{"to":101,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":104,"exit":"go","move":"go ramp"}]},
  {"id":104,"x":-760,"y":-640,"z":0,"title":"Steelclaw Clan, Lamentine Bridge","descriptions":["From the dizzying height of Lamentine Bridge, the countryside unfolds like a weaver's tapestry with the green and amber of orchards and grain fields stitched neatly together by roads and fences.  Planks worn smooth by the footfall of a dozen generations, the bridge sways slightly under the hand of the wind."],"exits":[{"to":105,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":103,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":105,"x":-760,"y":-660,"z":0,"title":"Steelclaw Clan, Lamentine Bridge","descriptions":["As the bridge's endcap draws nigh, the bulk and size of the motte can be clearly seen.  Tons of clay, soil and rock have been layered and then pounded into a solid mound that rises two stories above the bailey and provides an obstacle that even the most determined foe would find difficult.  Perched upon the crown of the motte sits the austere walls of the Barbarian Guild."],"exits":[{"to":106,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":104,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":106,"x":-760,"y":-680,"z":0,"title":"Steelclaw Clan, Motte","descriptions":["Fresh-faced men and women, dressed in apprentice black, gather about veteran warriors and snatches of generous praise and sharp corrections can be heard as a disarm technique is displayed or grip adjusted.  Other apprentices, younger than the rest and carrying bundles, rush towards and from the path leading down into the bailey.  Black flagstones trail towards the marquetry doors of the guild.","Lanterns, hung on tall poles, cast pools of light upon the flagstones and guild doors, attracting night insects who flutter about the edges.  An occasional bat can be seen swooping through the light in chase and though no one is visible, from the shadows floats the unmistakable feeling of being watched."],"exits":[{"to":105,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":205,"exit":"go","move":"go marquetry doors"},{"to":554,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden shack"}]},
  {"id":107,"x":-730,"y":-600,"z":0,"title":"Steelclaw Clan, Chapel Garden","descriptions":["Clumps of deep green thyme, tall chamomile plants, their heads dusted in gold, and soft coral periwinkles intertwine their leaves in a living quilt, warming the harsh grey stone of the chapel that rises above it.  With its tall twin doors standing open, the chapel patiently waits for all those having need of their god's presence."],"exits":[{"to":108,"exit":"go","move":"go doors"},{"to":102,"exit":"go","move":"go rosewood arch"}]},
  {"id":108,"x":-720,"y":-600,"z":0,"title":"Steelclaw Clan, Chapel","descriptions":["Leaded glass windows fill the eastern wall, allowing the first light of day to illuminate the intricate mosaic that covers the chapel floor from wall to wall.  At each of the other three cardinal points an altar stands - the southern one formed of living wood, the northern of a roughly hewn slab of basalt and the western carved from bone.  Dozens of candles, guttering nubs and brightly burning pillars, adorn each altar yet the surfaces and facings are clean, without wax drip or scorch mark."],"exits":[{"to":107,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#A6A3D9","aliases":["Shrine3-4","Chapel"]},
  {"id":109,"x":-560,"y":-460,"z":0,"title":"Jademist River, Edge of the Fields","descriptions":["Tall wooden fences stand reaching for the sky, their thin, lanky forms protectively guarding the precious fields behind them."],"exits":[{"to":110,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":81,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":656,"exit":"go","move":"go heavy gate"}]},
  {"id":110,"x":-540,"y":-480,"z":0,"title":"Beside the Jademist River, The Road to Shard","descriptions":["The road moves slightly away from the river.  To the south, expansive fields of golden wheat spread out as far as the eye can see, gilding the path to the crystal city beyond."],"exits":[{"to":111,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":109,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":671,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":111,"x":-520,"y":-500,"z":0,"title":"Beside the Jademist River, The Road to Shard","descriptions":["A slender sword of gleaming silver heralds the presence of Shard on the distant southern horizon where the city shimmers in the sun.  The blackness of the forest to the north is easily forgotten, even in the distant presence of such splendor.  The Jademist River vanishes on its way southeast, disappearing into fields of golden wheat.","A slender sword of faint silver heralds the presence of Shard on the distant southern horizon where the city shimmers in the moonlight.  The deep blackness of the forest to the north is easily forgotten, even in the distant presence of such splendor.  The Jademist River vanishes on its way southeast, disappearing into fields of gray wheat."],"exits":[{"to":112,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":110,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":112,"x":-520,"y":-520,"z":0,"title":"Beside the Jademist River, The Road to Shard","descriptions":["The churning rapids of the Jademist River slow as they skirt the road, their fine mist settling over the ground and curling about you in lazy circles.  The jagged mountains break out of the canopy of dense forest, their snowy white peaks distant and austere."],"exits":[{"to":113,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":111,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":113,"x":-500,"y":-540,"z":0,"title":"Beside the Jademist River, The Road to Shard","descriptions":["The rapids of the Jademist rush by, hurrying southeastward.  Small flowers dare to bloom near the water's edge, petals bearing foamy droplets that have strayed from their path.  The road dances dangerously close to the angry river, playing touch-and-go with the high bank as it winds south and north."],"exits":[{"to":114,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":112,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":114,"x":-480,"y":-560,"z":0,"title":"Beside the Jademist River, The Road to Shard","descriptions":["The river is at its widest and most furious here.  Like an angered lioness, it rages southward as if caught in a frenzy.  Rapids rush by, water breaking against rocks and stony banks.  The gentle fog that hazes over the moving surface partially hides the danger of being swept away in the violent currents."],"exits":[{"to":115,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":113,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"aliases":["ruined caravan"]},
  {"id":115,"x":-480,"y":-580,"z":0,"title":"Edge of the Wood, The Western Riverbank","descriptions":["A small white bridge gracefully arches over the rushing water of the furious Jademist River.  The soft pattering of the water's movements sings a cadence as alluring as any fae's melody.  A curious pale green fog lurks around the stones near the edge of the riverbank, occluding the rapidly shifting surface.","The white paint of a small bridge reflects the white-hot light of twinkling stars above.  It shimmers in the darkness, the rushing water beneath echoing in the stillness of the night."],"exits":[{"to":116,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":114,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":198,"exit":"go","move":"go small bridge"}],"color":"#008000"},
  {"id":116,"x":-480,"y":-600,"z":0,"title":"Edge of the Wood, Western Riverbank","descriptions":["A great river courses strong and proud beside the road, a light mist softly rising from its surface.  Rocks jutting from the banks try to catch the running water, daring to thwart its progress, yet it runs on steadily."],"exits":[{"to":117,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":115,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#008000"},
  {"id":117,"x":-460,"y":-620,"z":0,"title":"Edge of the Wood, The Western Riverbank","descriptions":["The western riverbank of the Jademist River flanks the road, both for the moment holding a mutual course through Ilithi.  Further north lies the dense lushness of the Dragon's Breath Forest, while to the south, the road meanders toward the mystical Lake of Tears.","The western riverbank flanks the road, its surface darkened by the setting of the sun.  To the north, the dense Dragon's Breath Forest seems impenetrable, an impassible wall of dense vegetation."],"exits":[{"to":118,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":116,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#008000"},
  {"id":118,"x":-440,"y":-640,"z":0,"title":"Edge of the Wood, Cove by the River","descriptions":["A small cove dips into the edge of the forest, the trees leaning back just enough to allow a shallow pool to collect beneath them, their bright green leaves skimming against the glass-like surface of the water.","A shallow pool rests covered in a dense mist, the fog too thick to see through.  The soft whistling of a nightingale's song echoes like a whisper sounding through the forest, the haunting notes lingering in the treetops."],"exits":[{"to":119,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":117,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#008000"},
  {"id":119,"x":-440,"y":-660,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Breath Forest, Edge of the Wood","descriptions":["Very little sunlight streaks through the dense canopy of brush to the north.  Even here, where the forest thins, the lingering darkness of the trees seems to settle like an ill wind brushing over a grave.","The tip of Wyvern Mountain peeks over the night's southern horizon, its snowy tip flush against the velvet night.  A thousand twinkling stars provide the only scarce light to illuminate the path."],"exits":[{"to":120,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":118,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":704,"exit":"go","move":"go cedar gates"}],"color":"#008000"},
  {"id":120,"x":-440,"y":-680,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Breath Forest, A Dark Path","descriptions":["To the south and the east, the glistening movement of water glimmers brightly through the scale-like leaves of the dense growth surrounding the road, the distant sound of rushing water confirming the presence of a river nearby.  The forest stands tall and stark, a wall of impermeable vegetation save where the road has carved its way through.","Jade-green leaves glisten, their scale-like surface almost reptilian in nature.  The path winds north and south, shadows of the night greeting both directions and limiting the view."],"exits":[{"to":121,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":119,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#008000"},
  {"id":121,"x":-420,"y":-700,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Breath Forest, A Dark Path","descriptions":["The forest begins to lose some of its denseness as it thins to the south. The canopy above is interspersed with shafts of light, the trees allowing light to fall through to dapple the path below them.","Moonlight pierces the dense canopy of leaves, leaves eerily trembling before the intruding illumination.  Patches of blue, grey, and red mottle the path, colored like stained glass."],"exits":[{"to":122,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":120,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":141,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#008000"},
  {"id":122,"x":-420,"y":-720,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Breath Forest, A Dark Path","descriptions":["Rocks and stones lie scattered along the path, the road crumbling as roots and vines grow into it.  This is a place not often walked by travelers.  The denseness of nature, as if this was her very heart, is quite apparent.  To the east, a faint break in the walls of green shows an otherwise unnoticeable branch in the path."],"exits":[{"to":123,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":140,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":121,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#008000"},
  {"id":123,"x":-400,"y":-740,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Breath Forest, A Dark Path","descriptions":["The dark twisting forms of eerie trees curl and twine towards the sky.  Gnarled branches bearing dense leaves with sharp edges glisten with a keen edge."],"exits":[{"to":124,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":122,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#008000"},
  {"id":124,"x":-400,"y":-760,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Breath Forest, A Dark Path","descriptions":["Trees close in around you, dark shadows like angry ghosts looming sullenly in unidentifiable shapes.  A flash of movement, a rustle in the leaves, and it is easy to understand why so many swear that this forest possesses a preternatural sentience.  Leaves, sharp like keen, straight blades, extend from the dense underbrush to languidly stab at the air.","The cool night wind rustles leaves sharp as blades, their surface glistening with a metallic sheen.  A call, a song of a bird lost within the brush, echoes through the uncanny silence."],"exits":[{"to":125,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":123,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#008000"},
  {"id":125,"x":-340,"y":-780,"z":0,"title":"Fayrin's Rest, Telgi Mod'Sunhin","descriptions":["Massive oaks extend a silver-grey canopy of leaves that fades quickly into inkblack darkness from here to the east, north and south.  The air shimmers and whispers sibilantly of long growth and gradual decay.  A few slender cedars and elm mark the beginning of a denser forest to the west, one marked by greater undergrowth and steeper rises.  You also see a small obelisk.","Massive oaks extend a silver-grey canopy of leaves that fades quickly into inkblack darkness from here to the east, north and south.  The air shimmers and whispers softly, sibilantly, of long growth and and gradual decay.  A few slender cedars and elms mark the beginning of a denser forest to the west, one marked by greater undergrowth and steeper rises.  You also see a small, faintly glowing obelisk.","Massive oaks extend a silver-grey canopy of leaves that fades quickly into inkblack darkness from here to the east, north and south.  The air shimmers and whispers softly, sibilantly, of long growth and gradual decay.  A few slender cedars and elms mark the beginning of a denser forest to the west, one marked by greater undergrowth and steeper rises.  You also see a small, faintly glowing obelisk.","Massive oaks extend a silver-grey canopy of leaves that fades quickly into inkblack darkness from here to the east, north and south.  The air shimmers and whispers softly, sibilantly, of long growth and gradual decay.  A few slender cedars and elms mark the beginning of a denser forest to the west, one marked by greater undergrowth and steeper rises."],"exits":[{"to":126,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":124,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":126,"x":-320,"y":-780,"z":0,"title":"Fayrin's Rest, Telgi Mod'Sunhin","descriptions":["The road winds with easy grace through a lightly wooded clearing.  A large burrow of Halflings snuggles against a cedar to the north, fitted with a series of curtained windows and filtered vents.  To the other side of the Telgi is an ancient oak, gnarled with age and disease."],"exits":[{"to":127,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":125,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":192,"exit":"climb","move":"climb narrow staircase"}]},
  {"id":127,"x":-300,"y":-800,"z":0,"title":"Fayrin's Rest, Anloraten Crossing","descriptions":["It is not much of a meeting place for roads and their travelers: a broad lane wandering through an impressive forest, a dirt path created from disturbed underbrush.  But such as it is, this crossing is a major traffic area for Fayrin's Rest.  Several local residents sit on benches in front of small dwellings to watch the arrivals and departures, by turns amused, pleased, curious and disdainful of what they see.","It is not much of a meeting place for roads and their travelers: a broad lane and a dirt path wandering through a forest as dark as the night and twice as long.  But such as it is, this crossing is a major traffic area for Fayrin's Rest.  A few local residents leave their small dwellings to come here after dark, sitting on benches and watching the arrivals and departures -- by turns amused, pleased, curious and disdainful."],"exits":[{"to":128,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":129,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":139,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":126,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"aliases":["Fayrin's Rest"]},
  {"id":128,"x":-300,"y":-820,"z":0,"title":"Fayrin's Rest, Jarrowkin Path","descriptions":["Bright lights shine from the south, for Anloraten Crossing lies that direction.  Warm lights glow to the north, however, where an enormous oak ends the path.  No simple aged tree, this.  It's an oak that's broader than many a house, with branches as thick and sturdy as a S'lai Guard.  There's a sign attached to the oak, and an entryway that leads inside to many cheerfully raised voices and the welcome smell of homecooked food."],"exits":[{"to":127,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":142,"exit":"go","move":"go entry"}]},
  {"id":129,"x":-200,"y":-800,"z":0,"title":"Fayrin's Rest, Telgi Mod'Sunhin","descriptions":["A burrow and a few inconspicuous squat houses sit off both sides of the road, almost completely concealed by oaks and cedars, elms and waves of rolling brown earth.  A few Halfling children watch you discreetly as they create and manage a town several feet long, comprised of small pebbles, twigs and a devoured turkey leg.  One of the children winks so briefly that it might have been a joke shared among the light, the thin emerald shade and the two of you.","This portion of the road seems deserted save for the silent sentry of long, slender saplings and longer, heavier trees that drape protectively over the road.  Animals stir through the undergrowth, and a kirikante shrills a sharp chpppt! somewhere in the distance.  To the east darkness burgeons sublime.  To the west and north a soft glow radiates warmth...a glow that bespeaks food, a roof, and companionship over a drink."],"exits":[{"to":130,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":127,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":132,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":130,"x":-180,"y":-800,"z":0,"title":"Fayrin's Rest, Telgi Mod'Sunhin","descriptions":["The forest is shady here, beneath towering oaks that spread their branches like gods chanting spells of creation.  Small cylindrical houses of limed earth and wood cluster at ground level.  People engaged in gardening and chatting with neighbors glance briefly your way and nod, before returning to their activities."],"exits":[{"to":131,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":129,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":131,"x":-160,"y":-820,"z":0,"title":"The Edge of the Forest, Before the Dragon's Breath","descriptions":["The lushness of the forest begins to form a living wall, the leaves of the towering trees tinted with the dark hue of brightly-polished scales.  The path to the north dwindles into the more sinister area of the harsh mountains."],"exits":[{"to":130,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":151,"exit":"go","move":"go woodland path"}],"color":"#008000"},
  {"id":132,"x":-220,"y":-820,"z":0,"title":"Fayrin's Rest, Modren Daelfa","descriptions":["A twisting path winds a lazy route through the brush and bracken.  Nearby, several small homes encircle the base of an elderly oak, like tiny acorns shed by the massive tree.  The delicious smell of fresh bread wafts from one of the homes, mingling comfortably with the cool scents of the surrounding woodland."],"exits":[{"to":138,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":129,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":133,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":134,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":133,"x":-260,"y":-820,"z":0,"title":"Fayrin's Rest, Modren Daelfa","descriptions":["A grassy mound punctuated by cheerful red and yellow doors runs along one side of the path as it curves around the base of an enormous cedar.  Small wooden homes cluster beneath the tree's spreading branches, their rooftops accumulating a layer of scented needles which drop softly from above with every stirring of the breeze."],"exits":[{"to":134,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":132,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":135,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":134,"x":-240,"y":-840,"z":0,"title":"Fayrin's Rest, Modren Daelfa","descriptions":["Water tumbles along the bed of a stream to the north, sparkling as it catches the light.  Along its banks, patches of wildflowers and ferns grow around moss-covered treestumps, dotting the area with splashes of color.  Several homes stand near the stream, enjoying the tranquil melody of the brook and blending softly with the vivid natural beauty of the woods.","Water tumbles along the bed of a stream to the north, sparkling where it catches the light.  The air is filled with the sound of frogs croaking in their nightly chorus.  Several homes stand near the stream, sharing the tranquil melody of the brook with the night's inquisitive wildlife."],"exits":[{"to":137,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":138,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":132,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":133,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":135,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":136,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":135,"x":-280,"y":-840,"z":0,"title":"Fayrin's Rest, Modren Daelfa","descriptions":["A stone bridge arches over a creek to the northeast as the trail continues to wind its way through the trees.  A cluster of willows leans over the edge of the stream, their pale green fronds dangling down to drift along in the water."],"exits":[{"to":134,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":133,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":136,"exit":"go","move":"go stone bridge"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":136,"x":-260,"y":-860,"z":0,"title":"Fayrin's Rest, Modren Daelfa","descriptions":["The air is sweet with the smell of apples that grow in a tiny clearing beside a nearby stream.  A stone bridge crosses the stream to the southwest, the water babbling cheerfully as it tumbles over the smooth rock-lined streambed.  Pale yellow, purple and white irises grow in profusion along the banks of the stream, their yellow-bearded blossoms swaying gently in the breeze."],"exits":[{"to":137,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":134,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":135,"exit":"go","move":"go stone bridge"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":137,"x":-220,"y":-860,"z":0,"title":"Fayrin's Rest, Modren Daelfa","descriptions":["The path bends as it curves around the trunk of an aged ash tree.  Bees fly in and out of a hole in the tree, their wings buzzing with a monotonous drone as they bear their burden of nectar back to the local hive.  Several small homes crouch in the shade of the tree, their brightly-painted front doors picking out the colors of the surrounding wildflowers.","The path bends as it curves around the trunk of an aged ash tree.  The low drone of crickets drifts from its branches, filling the night air with soft music.  Several small homes crouch in the shadow of the tree, warm yellow light glowing through their cheerfully-colored curtains."],"exits":[{"to":138,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":134,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":136,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":138,"x":-200,"y":-840,"z":0,"title":"Fayrin's Rest, Modren Daelfa","descriptions":["A patch of close-cropped grass stands between the trail and a cluster of rustic homes.  In parts, the area is muddied by small hoofprints, and a noticeable thinning in the low-level foliage suggests this area is regularly grazed by local herds.  A few clumps of bright yellow ragwort have managed to escape consumption, thanks only to the bitter taste of their flowers."],"exits":[{"to":132,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":134,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":137,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":139,"x":-280,"y":-780,"z":0,"title":"Fayrin's Rest, Jarrowkin Path","descriptions":["Rows of spruce trees border the paved road that leads downhill to an outpost, a stable and a large stone inn.  A carved marble fountain rests in the center of the road, helping to separate the incoming and departing caravans.  On a nearby hillside, a flock of sheep grazes, oblivious to the industrious traffic."],"exits":[{"to":127,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":524,"exit":"go","move":"go trader outpost"},{"to":526,"exit":"go","move":"go stable"},{"to":756,"exit":"go","move":"go stone inn"}]},
  {"id":140,"x":-400,"y":-720,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Breath Forest, A Dark Path","descriptions":["The outline of a small dwelling manages to break through the dense forest before being swallowed back up by a screen of leaves and branches.  Motes of light drift softly through the air, glinting with the promise of a sun so rarely seen here.","The outline of a small dwelling manages to break through the dense forest before being swallowed back up by a screen of leaves and branches.  Ragged patches of moonlight break through the trees before disappearing like a drowning victim beneath the surface of a dark and unforgiving lake."],"exits":[{"to":122,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":194,"exit":"go","move":"go crumbling doorway"}],"color":"#008000"},
  {"id":141,"x":-440,"y":-700,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Breath Forest, A Dark Path","descriptions":["The forest here deepens, walls of green thriving with life untapped by mortals for its precious resources. A break in the trees leads deeper into the blackness of the forest, the absence of light dissuading reckless progress."],"exits":[{"to":121,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":196,"exit":"go","move":"go break"}],"color":"#008000"},
  {"id":142,"x":-360,"y":-880,"z":0,"title":"Marachek's Oak, Main Hall","descriptions":["Everything in this spacious reception area has been whittled or sculpted from the giant oak, all save the glowing eggs and Marachek himself.  The latter sits on a high stool behind a counter opposite the stairwell and a longcase clock, beaming brightly, always willing to meet new arrivals or ask departing visitors to return as soon as possible.  They usually do, drawn off the road outside to Marachek's Oak by its reputation for hospitality."],"exits":[{"to":147,"exit":"go","move":"go small archway"},{"to":148,"exit":"go","move":"go longcase clock"},{"to":128,"exit":"go","move":"go road"},{"to":143,"exit":"go","move":"go blue door"},{"to":144,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ornate stairwell"}]},
  {"id":143,"x":-340,"y":-900,"z":0,"title":"Marachek's Oak, Feasterie","descriptions":["The walls of this large, round eatery bulge like the sides of a filled barrel.  Tables and chairs radiate outwards like spokes on a wheel from a cylindrical buffet in the center of the room, heaped with good food and serviced from within by several plump, beaming Halflings.  Aside from a secluded booth to one side all is festive excitement, set to the tune of clattering kitchen utensils echoing up from below."],"exits":[{"to":142,"exit":"go","move":"go blue door"},{"to":527,"exit":"go","move":"go secluded booth"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Feasterie"]},
  {"id":144,"x":-360,"y":-860,"z":0,"title":"Marachek's Oak, Hallway","descriptions":["A gold rug runs the length of this passageway with its rounded walls, damping the sound of footsteps to a softly sushing rustle.  The only light filters up from below the stairs, lending a deep, dark glow to this tranquil corridor."],"exits":[{"to":145,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":142,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ornate stairwell"}]},
  {"id":145,"x":-360,"y":-840,"z":0,"title":"Marachek's Oak, Hallway","descriptions":["This portion of the second floor passageway lives in perpetual dusk.  The air smells of freshly fallen leaves and damp, gravid earth.  A heavily carved chair stands sentry at the end of the hall, under an old faded tapestry whose design can barely be made out."],"exits":[{"to":144,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":146,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"}]},
  {"id":146,"x":-340,"y":-840,"z":0,"title":"Marachek's Oak, Wedding Chapel","descriptions":["An air of quiet solemnity hangs over this room, so atypical in Marachek's Oak.  White stones that radiate a soft, even light line the floor's edge like wise, silent curates.  A low, round pedestal of grey marble rests beneath a slowly turning copper disk.  It hangs from a crosshatched wattle roof several feet above the highest visitor, beyond which lies only deeper shadows receding upwards into the tree."],"exits":[{"to":145,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"}],"color":"#A6A3D9","aliases":["Wedding Chapel","shrine"]},
  {"id":147,"x":-380,"y":-900,"z":0,"title":"Marachek's Oak, Den","descriptions":["This cozy sitting room centers around a small fireplace aglow with softly sizzling pinecones and oak logs.  Instead of the usual, endless animal trophies there are Marachek family memorabilia scattered across every available surface...including a stuffed, lifesize Halfling Barbarian in one corner."],"exits":[{"to":142,"exit":"go","move":"go small archway"}]},
  {"id":148,"x":-360,"y":-900,"z":0,"title":"Marachek's Oak, Merchant Central","descriptions":["Down steeply from the main floor, Marachek's shops cluster around the root structure of the grand oak.  This room is large, round and low, and edged by brightly colored doors.  Floored with stamped earth, the air still smells clean, woody and sweet -- a testament to Halfling engineering ingenuity, developed over generations of burrow building."],"exits":[{"to":149,"exit":"go","move":"go blue door"},{"to":150,"exit":"go","move":"go green door"},{"to":142,"exit":"go","move":"go longcase clock"}]},
  {"id":149,"x":-380,"y":-920,"z":0,"title":"Marachek's Weapons Emporium","descriptions":["A young, serious Halfling oversees the display and sale of arms and ammunition in this store.  He glances proudly from time to time at the clean counters and gleaming items, lined up at attention like so many grim, bright militia."],"exits":[{"to":148,"exit":"go","move":"go blue door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Weapons Emporium"]},
  {"id":150,"x":-340,"y":-920,"z":0,"title":"Marachek's General Store","descriptions":["This shelf-lined room serves as display and inventory space for a seemingly endless variety of travelers' supplies.  Their bright colors and protean shapes spill across the floor, forcing customers to walk around or wade through the jumble to find a particular item.  Fortunately, the store catalog is close to the door."],"exits":[{"to":148,"exit":"go","move":"go green door"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["General Store"]},
  {"id":151,"x":-140,"y":-840,"z":0,"title":"Obsidian Pass, Foothills","descriptions":["A wooded path winds its way through some low foothills on the edge of both forest and mountain.  To the south stands the Forest of the Dragon's Breath, a place of much myth and legend.  To the north, the Spine Mountains rise over the land, their jagged peaks tearing rents into the sky.","The shadows of the mountains beyond trickles over the descending edge of the foothills.  Patches of green reflect the sparse light of stars twinkling far above.  A wooded path winds its way southward."],"exits":[{"to":152,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":131,"exit":"go","move":"go wooded path"}],"color":"#008000","aliases":["RTI13","RT-GPS-S"]},
  {"id":152,"x":-160,"y":-860,"z":0,"title":"Obsidian Pass, The Edge of the Forest","descriptions":["The tall shadow of the Spine Mountains towers into the skies, casting a dark shroud over the area.  Thin, green grasses and small wiry flowers eat away at the crumbling rock here at the base of the foothills.  Their presence signifies the proximity of the forest's edge.","The shadows of the mountains beyond trickles over the descending edge of the foothills.  Patches of green reflect the sparse light of stars twinkling far above."],"exits":[{"to":153,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":151,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":157,"exit":"go","move":"go switchback path"}],"color":"#C2B280","aliases":["RTI02","RT-GPS-GR"]},
  {"id":153,"x":-160,"y":-880,"z":0,"title":"Obsidian Pass, Mountain Trail","descriptions":["The packed-down road that winds its way through the mountains glitters with chips of onyx that have been embedded in it, lending the pass its darkling name.  The Spine Mountains stretch like an arched cat to the east and west.  Said to be the only part of the World Dragon visible through the shell of the earth that encases the mythic creature, the little fable seems to be confounded by the fact that the mountain is clearly stone and earth, not scale and bone."],"exits":[{"to":154,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":152,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#C2B280","aliases":["RTI01","RT-GPS-HC"]},
  {"id":154,"x":-140,"y":-900,"z":0,"title":"Obsidian Pass, Mountain Trail","descriptions":["The trail from the south comes to an end at a half-built stone tower on the edge of a chasm.  Above the unfinished walls of the tower rise two granite pillars, from which thick ropes extend hundreds of feet across the canyon.  Large metal pulleys suspended between the pillars creak as they turn ceaselessly."],"exits":[{"to":153,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":155,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":155,"x":-220,"y":-900,"z":0,"title":"Obsidian Pass, Chasm's Ridge","descriptions":["A room-in-progress is rising around a large paved area as stone blocks are being mortared into place, enclosing the granite pillars anchoring the gondola ropes.  An oak door is already hung at one end of the room, and through a more elaborate frame at the north end, the gondola platform can be seen."],"exits":[{"to":156,"exit":"go","move":"go door frame"},{"to":154,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"}]},
  {"id":156,"x":-220,"y":-920,"z":0,"title":"Obsidian Pass, Platform","descriptions":["The greying wooden boards of the platform have been replaced by paving stones.  Two massive granite pillars offer support for a set of thick rope cables that allow the gondola served by this platform to cross the chasm.  Stacks of building stones and mortar lie off to one side, ready to add to the structure being raised around the landing."],"exits":[{"to":218,"exit":"go","move":"go gondola"},{"to":155,"exit":"go","move":"go door frame"}],"color":"#FF00FF","aliases":["Platform","Gondola"]},
  {"id":157,"x":-10,"y":-760,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Mountain Foothills","descriptions":["The trail becomes spotty as it meanders its way along the rock strewn canyon beside a wide riverbed containing a tiny trickle of water.  Sage and juniper cover backsides of steep tan sandstone hogback ridges that angle downward toward Shard.  Underbrush rustles as tiny brown sparrows, blue-bellied lizards, and russet squirrels forage for food.","The trail meanders its way along the canyon.","The trail becomes spotty as it meanders its way along the rock strewn canyon beside a wide riverbed containing a tiny trickle of water.  Sage and juniper cover backsides of steep tan sandstone hogback ridges that angle downward toward Shard.  Foliage on the underbrush rustles, dancing to the cold night breeze blowing down off the mountains."],"exits":[{"to":158,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":152,"exit":"go","move":"go switchback path"}],"color":"#C2B280","aliases":["RTI14","RT-GPS-CW"]},
  {"id":158,"x":10,"y":-780,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Mountain Foothills","descriptions":["Winding its way around one of the steep ridges, the rutted path travels between hills.  Small dirty gray white patches fill the chill shadows cast by an abundance of thick brush and large stately oaks.  High overhead a kestrel floats, hovering on updrafts as it circles for game.","Winding its way around one of the steep ridges, the rutted path travels between hills.","Winding its way around one of the steep ridges, the rutted path travels between hills.  Small dirty gray white patches, beside the abundant thick brush and tall large stately oaks, gleam brightly under moonlight.  The cries of night birds and the occasional hoot of an owl can be heard from the nearby trees."],"exits":[{"to":157,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":159,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":159,"x":-10,"y":-800,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Mountain Foothills","descriptions":["The foothills quickly bow in submission to the majesty of the Spine of the World Dragon Mountains.  Icespear Peak dominates the view as it thrusts impressively skyward vanishing into fleecy clouds that wreath the summit in mystery.  The white robed mountains seem to extend into infinity to both the east and west, and offer little in the way of passage.","Icespear Peak dominates the view as it thrusts impressively skyward.  The white robed mountains seem to extend into infinity to both the east and west."],"exits":[{"to":160,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":158,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":160,"x":-10,"y":-820,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Canyon Trail","descriptions":["Following the narrow gorge, the path becomes arduous as it climbs over rock falls and between tangles of river debris.  High upon the canyon rim, abundant pine, fir, and spruce flourish but grow more sparse as they descend upon the canyon walls until only the occasional doughty bush or tenacious pine cling precariously to the mountainside.","Following the narrow gorge, the path becomes arduous as it climbs over rock falls and between tangles of river debris."],"exits":[{"to":161,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":159,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":161,"x":10,"y":-840,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, River Camp","descriptions":["The canyon widens, its slope less severe, as the trail climbs steeply into the mountains.  Icy clear water trickles though a small channel in the boulder strewn stream bed.  A small circle of charcoal blackened stones grace a small flat sandbar that is nestled like a comb between the braids of the twining riverbed.","The canyon widens, its slope less severe, as the trail climbs steeply into the mountains.  Icy clear water trickles though a small channel in the boulder strewn stream bed."],"exits":[{"to":160,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":162,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":497,"exit":"none","move":"script dragonspine"}]},
  {"id":162,"x":-10,"y":-840,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Mountain Shadow","descriptions":["Temperature drops dramatically as the canyon weaves westerly into the shadow of the World Dragon's Spine.  Abruptly, the scenery is transformed into a wonderland of ice that glitters and shimmers in the canyon as the trickling stream finds its source at the melting edge of a wide and frozen river.  Icicle lances drape from seeps on the ice shattered canyon walls.","Temperature drops dramatically as the canyon weaves westerly into the shadow of the World Dragon's Spine.  Abruptly, the trickling stream finds its source at the melting edge of a wide and frozen river."],"exits":[{"to":161,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":163,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":163,"x":-40,"y":-840,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Astrar's Sorrow","descriptions":["The canyon terminates in frosty splendor, though the trail continues on, steeply switch-backing its way up the slick mountainside beside a stunning waterfall.  Hanging from a valley far above, Astrar's Sorrow descends as a glittering cascade of frozen water forming a pleated veil of icy tears that fall perpetually without movement to the solid river of ice below.","The canyon terminates in frosty splendor, though the trail continues on, steeply switch-backing its way up the slick mountainside beside a stunning waterfall."],"exits":[{"to":162,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":164,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":165,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":317,"exit":"go","move":"go small crevice"},{"to":167,"exit":"climb","move":"climb waterfall"}],"aliases":["Astrar's Sorrow"]},
  {"id":164,"x":-60,"y":-840,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Steps of Sorrow","descriptions":["Crystallized rocks and frost-covered foliage glitter like diamonds in the snow, reflecting light from a thousand facets.  The brisk wind brings with it a faint pungent odor, quickly gone with its next breath of frosty air."],"exits":[{"to":163,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":643,"exit":"climb","move":"go steps"}],"aliases":["Steps of Sorrow"]},
  {"id":165,"x":0,"y":-860,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Mountainside Trail","descriptions":["The wind swirls small dervishes of snow as it gusts down the steep mountain side frosting pine trunks with a glassy sheen.  A frozen, snow-covered yak gives mute testimony to the bitter extremes of the treacherous passage over the Spine Mountains.","The wind swirls small dervishes of snow as it gusts down the steep mountain side frosting pine trunks with a glassy sheen."],"exits":[{"to":166,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":163,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":166,"x":0,"y":-880,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Mountainside Trail","descriptions":["Ice crunches underfoot, rutted by the footsteps of all that have gone before, making the narrow passage unreliable and difficult.  To the north, the pine covered mountainside looms while to the west lies a spectacular view... Astrar's Sorrow, a frozen cascade of ice that plummets to the river of ice... far far below, lending to thoughts of vertigo.","Ice crunches underfoot, rutted by the footsteps of all that have gone before, making the narrow passage unreliable and difficult."],"exits":[{"to":167,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":165,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":167,"x":0,"y":-900,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Canyon Rim","descriptions":["The wind howls as you crest the side of the canyon rim, making it difficult to maintain balance.  Nearby, a glacial river of ice disappears off the edge of the mountain.  A large snow filled basin, corralled by craggy black glassy stone, slopes gently upward toward a notch to the north.  To the northeast lies an outcrop of rounded grey white boulders while to the northwest the basin is obscured by heavy mist.","The wind howls as you crest the side of the canyon rim, making it difficult to maintain balance.    A large snow filled basin slopes toward a notch to the north.  To the northeast lies an outcrop of rounded grey white boulders."],"exits":[{"to":169,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":168,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":166,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":163,"exit":"climb","move":"climb waterfall"},{"to":172,"exit":"go","move":"go icy riverbank"}]},
  {"id":168,"x":20,"y":-920,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, South Ridge","descriptions":["A long ridge in the form of gargantuan spherical diorite boulders towers over the meadow, the salt and peppered rock standing sharply in contrast to the virgin white snow surrounding it.  Large clawed footprints of some bipedal beast lead toward a crack in the rock.","A long ridge towers over the meadow."],"exits":[{"to":167,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":169,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":175,"exit":"go","move":"go crack"}]},
  {"id":169,"x":0,"y":-920,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Basin Center","descriptions":["The trail vanishes beneath a cloak of white, though its path is obvious from a wake of disturbed snow that trudges wearily through wind rippled high drifts, making a beeline between the waterfall to the south and the pass in the dark glassy rocks to the north.","The trail vanishes beneath a cloak of disturbed snow between the waterfall to the south and the pass to the north."],"exits":[{"to":170,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":171,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":168,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":167,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":170,"x":0,"y":-940,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Basin North","descriptions":["To the north a mountain pass looms with high black glass walls filled with white vesicules.  Moving through the Halfling-high disturbed snow is a titanic struggle that threatens to overwhelm.  Wind rippled snowdrifts thicken toward the rocks, often rising up to your chest and always hiding rough irregular terrain beneath.","To the north a mountain pass looms with high black glass walls filled with white vesicules."],"exits":[{"to":171,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":169,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Yurt"]},
  {"id":171,"x":20,"y":-940,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, North Ridge","descriptions":["Blood stains, scattered fur and a solitary feather mar this peaceful clearing beside the bouldery ridge to the south.  A tragic tale is told in tiny paw prints that step warily toward the ridge, suddenly turn, and sprint hopelessly for the safety of a large scraggly white fir that stands as a solitary sentinel in the meadow.","Blood stains, scattered fur and a solitary feather mar this peaceful clearing beside the bouldery ridge to the south."],"exits":[{"to":169,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":170,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":172,"x":-20,"y":-920,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Frozen River","descriptions":["Steep-sided snow banks channel the wind down the frozen riverbed toward Astrar's sorrow.  Although slippery, the wind-swept ribbon of ice provides a relatively unobstructed path toward the foggy northwest.","Steep-sided snow banks channel the wind down the frozen riverbed toward foggy northwest."],"exits":[{"to":167,"exit":"go","move":"go canyon rim"},{"to":173,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":173,"x":-40,"y":-940,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Frozen River","descriptions":["A freezing wet mist falls heavily, limiting vision and shellacking the few sparse trees with a thick coat of ice that weighs heavily upon their limbs.  Where not shattered, the branches of the evergreens droop deeply toward the ground like an overburdened trader's arms.","A freezing wet mist falls heavily, limiting vision and shellacking the few sparse trees with a thick coat of ice that weighs heavily upon their limbs."],"exits":[{"to":172,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":174,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":174,"x":-60,"y":-940,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Frozen River","descriptions":["Cracked in places, the river ice thins as it disappears into an impenetrable jumble of huge jagged obsidian boulders that have tumbled from ridges that close on either side of the riverbed.  Large silver blurs can be seen swimming beneath the surface of the ice.","Cracked in places, the river ice thins as it disappears into an impenetrable jumble of huge jagged obsidian boulders."],"exits":[{"to":173,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":178,"exit":"climb","move":"climb obsidian boulders"}]},
  {"id":175,"x":40,"y":-920,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Snowbeast Lair","descriptions":["A small cavern-like area extends beneath the pile of boulders above, partially sealed by the eternal snow pack.  A craggy opening through a shattered boulder offers escape from the lair.  Numerous bones of small mammals mixed with a scattering of trader's pack animals and their owners remains litter the floor of the grotto.","A small cavern-like area extends beneath the pile of boulders above, partially sealed by the eternal snow pack.  A craggy opening through a shattered boulder offers escape from the lair."],"exits":[{"to":176,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":168,"exit":"go","move":"go opening"}]},
  {"id":176,"x":40,"y":-940,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Snowbeast Lair","descriptions":["Thick torn and matted skins are strewn across a nest of pine boughs on the floor of the lair.  Tufts of coarse white hair cling to the bed and the frosty walls.  A trickle of water drips off icicles hanging down from the snow pack above to disappear into the cracks in the rock below.","Thick torn and matted skins are strewn across a nest of pine boughs on the floor of the lair.  Tufts of coarse white hair cling to the bed and the frosty walls."],"exits":[{"to":177,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":175,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"aliases":["Snowbeast Lair"]},
  {"id":177,"x":60,"y":-960,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Snowbeast Larder","descriptions":["Half-eaten carcasses of deer, mountain lion, and bear fill this cranny.  The most recent addition seems to be the frozen bloody carcass of a young, white haired, Elven lad that lies on the floor beside shattered saber shards.","Half-eaten carcasses of deer, mountain lion, and bear fill this cranny."],"exits":[{"to":176,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"aliases":["Snowbeast Larder"]},
  {"id":178,"x":-60,"y":-960,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Peri'el's Mere","descriptions":["The veil of mist lifts toward the northwest, becoming thick low clouds that hang overhead and obscure this hidden vale nestled between ridges on the flanks of Icespear.  Lake ice is thick and solid against the mass of obsidian boulders that have sealed the vale.  Oddly, the ice thins and finally vanishes completely halfway across the valley to reveal a bright blue tarn that seems to be the source of the warm moisture in the air.","The veil of mist lifts toward the northwest.  Lake ice is thick and solid against the mass of obsidian boulders that have sealed the vale."],"exits":[{"to":179,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":174,"exit":"climb","move":"climb obsidian boulders"}],"aliases":["Peri'el's Mere"]},
  {"id":179,"x":-80,"y":-980,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Peri'el's Mere","descriptions":["Energetically, eddies of steam swirl upward from the surface of the western portion of Peri'el's Mere in contrast to the thick ice bordering the shore alongside the frozen trail.  Ahead, near the warmer portions of the lake's shore, structures can be seen.","Ahead, near the warmer portions of the lake's shore, structures can be seen."],"exits":[{"to":178,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":180,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":180,"x":-100,"y":-980,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Peri'el's Mere","descriptions":["Thawed by the warmth of Peri'el's heart, here even the ice of the Spine of the World Dragon Mountains is thawed.  Thick dark green moss lines boulders along the edge of the lake, while the water ripples madly as shining rainbow streaks flash upward to decimate a seemingly endless mosquito population.","Thick dark green moss lines boulders along the edge of the lake."],"exits":[{"to":179,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":181,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":181,"x":-120,"y":-980,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Peri'el's Mere","descriptions":["The shoreline makes a transition from winter white to the green of spring as pine, spruce, and lelori grow more abundant, hemming in the western shores of the Tarn.  Lush thick grasses envelop scattered building stones and rotting timbers in their passionate embrace.","Lush thick grasses envelop scattered building stones and rotting timbers in their passionate embrace."],"exits":[{"to":180,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":182,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":182,"x":-140,"y":-1000,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Lakeside Cabin","descriptions":["A solitary cabin still stands in this idyllic vale.  A short flagstone walkway, surrounded by an overgrown garden of feral herbs and flagrant foliage, surrenders to invasion.  A shattered door which owes its survival to the iron reinforcements that still hold fast the wood in places, hangs drunkenly from battered hinges.","A solitary cabin still stands in this idyllic vale."],"exits":[{"to":181,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":183,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":185,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":191,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}]},
  {"id":183,"x":-140,"y":-980,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Cabin Stable","descriptions":["A large A-frame structure, open at both ends, stands beside the battered cabin.  A couple of livery stalls fill the southern half of the structure.  A small work area is dominated by a large rust-red anvil anchored to a massive block of stone that dwarfs the fallen workbench beside it.","A large A-frame structure, open at both ends, stands beside the battered cabin."],"exits":[{"to":182,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":184,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":184,"x":-160,"y":-980,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Homestead Rubble","descriptions":["A single-ivy clad stone chimney stands tall amidst the ruin of several foundations.  Scattered stones and wooden rubble lie strewn about the former cluster of homes.  Tiny grey mice forage among the weeds that push their way upward between the rocks to reclaim what was rightfully theirs.","A single-ivy clad stone chimney stands tall amidst the ruin of several foundations."],"exits":[{"to":185,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":183,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":185,"x":-160,"y":-1020,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Swampy Meadow","descriptions":["An impenetrable briar of dark green bushes laden with bright red and white grackleberries hem in the lakeside trail as it meanders pleasantly through a lush thick meadow."],"exits":[{"to":186,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":182,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":184,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":186,"x":-160,"y":-1040,"z":0,"title":"Dragon Spine, Muddy Beach","descriptions":["Pawprints of squirrel, wren, and jay, mix with hoofprints of elk, deer, and moose in the warm soft mud beside the lake.  Hundreds of slimy grey tadpoles squirm among the algae-carpeted rocks in the warm still shallows.","Pawprints of squirrel, wren, and jay, mix with hoofprints of elk, deer, and moose in the warm soft mud beside the lake."],"exits":[{"to":185,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":187,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":187,"x":-180,"y":-1060,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Peri'el's Mere","descriptions":["Hundreds of bright red ladybird beetles swarm over small rounded boulders and dusty green brush.  Red-throated robins swoop down from the forest canopy to feed, only to be chased away by excessively territorial blue jays.","Hundreds of bright red ladybird beetles swarm over small rounded boulders and dusty green brush."],"exits":[{"to":186,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":188,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":188,"x":-200,"y":-1060,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Hot Springs","descriptions":["Effervescing pots, pools, and cauldrons lined with bright red, green, blue, and yellow encrustations burble merrily away.  Some are filled with thick viscous mud-like fluid while others are crystal clear.  A fetid odor overwhelms the area with the distinctive aroma of over-ripe eggs.","Effervescing pots, pools, and cauldrons burble merrily away."],"exits":[{"to":189,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":187,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"aliases":["Hot Springs"]},
  {"id":189,"x":-200,"y":-1080,"z":0,"title":"Dragon Spine, Peri'el's Mere","descriptions":["Even the ground itself is warm, no doubt in response to the steam-generating heat deep within.  A dark black blocky ridge extends outward into the tarn like a finger pointing to its warm heart.  About the end of the ridge, the water bubbles and froths violently providing a thick plume of steam that tethers the water to the protective blanket of clouds above.","A dark black blocky ridge extends outward into the tarn like a finger pointing to its warm heart."],"exits":[{"to":188,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":190,"exit":"climb","move":"climb black ridge"}]},
  {"id":190,"x":-200,"y":-1100,"z":0,"title":"Dragon Spine, Peri'el's Mere","descriptions":["From on top of the black rock promontory, the depths of the tarn can be seen through the clear crystal water.  Far beneath, the obsidian reef dives steeply to the lake bottom that deepens beyond visibility toward a bright orange glow.  A large dark shape, deep in the water, scatters schools of trout.","From on top of the black rock promontory, the depths of the tarn can be seen through the clear crystal water."],"exits":[{"to":189,"exit":"climb","move":"climb rock promontory"}]},
  {"id":191,"x":-120,"y":-1020,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Cabin Interior","descriptions":["The inside of the cabin is a large single room that was apparently divided by function.  One corner of the room is filled by a pile of moldy feathers that are covered by a rotting quilt.  Shattered crockery fragments litter the ground beside a wobbly table.  Dark brown stains splatter the walls."],"exits":[{"to":182,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}]},
  {"id":192,"x":-320,"y":-760,"z":0,"title":"Telgi Mod'Sunhin, Platform","descriptions":["This is a creaking platform that rises twenty feet above the forest floor.  The view is much the same as below, except for a small treehouse that stands before you.  Its roof is a crazy quilt of tattered cloth, rotted shingles, branches and vines.  The walls are dark and splintered, and smoke occasionally seeps out from the cracks."],"exits":[{"to":193,"exit":"go","move":"go small treehouse"},{"to":126,"exit":"climb","move":"climb narrow staircase"}]},
  {"id":193,"x":-320,"y":-750,"z":0,"title":"Telgi Mod'Sunhin, Enescu's Herbs","descriptions":["The sagging shelves of this hut are lined with dingy, filth-caked bottles filled with things of indeterminate color, size and shape.  Dust balls skid along the splintered floor dizzily.  A sputtering fire in a small brazier lends just enough light to the room to make any sensible person wish for complete darkness."],"exits":[{"to":192,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Enescu's Herbs","Herbs"]},
  {"id":194,"x":-380,"y":-720,"z":0,"title":"Biabo's Bug Collection, Front Parlor","descriptions":["An aged wooden floor is tessellated unevenly while the walls are boarded in dilapidated oak.  Large glass display cases sit atop unfired brick stands giving way to an elongated counter.  The attendant, Biabo, a middle-aged Gnome, peers over his thick spectacles inspecting a small cricket in the palm of his hand."],"exits":[{"to":195,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":140,"exit":"go","move":"go crumbling doorway"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Biabo's Bug Collection"]},
  {"id":195,"x":-380,"y":-700,"z":0,"title":"Biabo's Bug Collection, Basement","descriptions":["Dim candlelight illuminates the roots breaking through the crumbling basement walls.  Boxes and barrels are thrown about in disarray making it nearly impossible to navigate through the room.  A few more glass cases stand in the corner awaiting the arrival of Biabo's next shipment of insects."],"exits":[{"to":194,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":196,"x":-460,"y":-700,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Breath Forest, Through the Break","descriptions":["Darkness welcomes all visitors who enter here.  Amorphous forms lurk around the edges of your vision, forming unnameable shadows that tatter and dissipate when looked at directly.  Walls of green curve over and around the trail, forming a living barrier of verdant leaves that shimmer as they drape themselves over the overgrown path to the west.  A break in the trees leads back to the main forest."],"exits":[{"to":197,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":141,"exit":"go","move":"go break"}],"color":"#008000"},
  {"id":197,"x":-480,"y":-700,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Breath Forest, A Dark Clearing","descriptions":["A ring of dark walnut trees stands in ancient vigil over this small clearing, its austere presence contributing to the disquieting silence that seems palpable in this place.  The surrounding shadows bring an odd sense of comfort, as every glimmer of light reflected by a polished stone at the locus of the ring breeds the image of a predator lying in wait."],"exits":[{"to":196,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":198,"x":-460,"y":-580,"z":0,"title":"Jademist River, A Flowered Path","descriptions":["A small, well-tended path winds its way east, curling close to the rushing river.  Roses of a thousand hues guard the way, their silken faces opening to the sunlit skies above.","A well cared for path winds its way to the east, skirting perilously close to the riverbank.  Pale white roses bloom in the night air, their silken faces turned skyward."],"exits":[{"to":199,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":115,"exit":"go","move":"go white bridge"}]},
  {"id":199,"x":-440,"y":-580,"z":0,"title":"Jademist River, Rose Arbor","descriptions":["Dark blood-roses twine around a wrought iron arch that towers over the way to form an exquisite arbor.  The white stone path accents the darkling blossoms, striking a sparkling, fiery nuance into the richly colored petals."],"exits":[{"to":200,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":198,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":281,"exit":"go","move":"search go dirt path"}]},
  {"id":200,"x":-420,"y":-580,"z":0,"title":"Jademist River, Garden Path","descriptions":["To the east the path leads to a small garden, hidden away amidst a small grove of fruit trees.  To the west, the way leads back to the fury of the river and the main path.","To the east, the edge of a small garden raises its head, starlight reflecting off tiny white flowers.  To the west, the fury of the river drones on behind you."],"exits":[{"to":201,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":199,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":201,"x":-400,"y":-580,"z":0,"title":"Small Orchard, A Quiet Grove","descriptions":["Fruit trees link hands in a circle to form a quiet grove here.  Small flowers spring up around the wicker benches and white ironwood picnic table, creating a place of leisure, where one may sit and repose, thinking about days gone by, and things to come again.","Starfruit trees link hands in a circle to form a quiet grove here.  Small, drooping snowdrop flowers spring up around the wicker benches and white ironwood picnic table, creating a place of leisure, where one may sit and allow even the wildest dreams to distill into lucidity beneath the changing moonlight."],"exits":[{"to":200,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":318,"exit":"go","move":"go marble stairs"}]},
  {"id":202,"x":-800,"y":-540,"z":0,"title":"Steelclaw Clan, Dark Corner","descriptions":["Littered with odds and ends that have trickled off the surrounding piles, there is perhaps enough room for a large dog to lie down...if the dog were careful.  Heat from the composting of the organic materials makes the air oppressively warm and close."],"exits":[{"to":93,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":203,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ladder"},{"to":204,"exit":"go","move":"go small path"}]},
  {"id":203,"x":-800,"y":-560,"z":0,"title":"Steelclaw Clan, Watchtower","descriptions":["Passing through the slot cut for it in the floor, the ladder leads into one of the many watchtowers that dot the length of the palisade.  Bare of decoration aside from an oil-burning lantern and a small stool, arrow slits slash the walls on all sides, allowing an archer an easy field of fire against invaders, whether outside the Clan or in the bailey."],"exits":[{"to":202,"exit":"climb","move":"climb ladder"}]},
  {"id":204,"x":-820,"y":-540,"z":0,"title":"Steelclaw Clan, Bailey Wall","descriptions":["Tucked away in a small niche formed by the hills of scrap and debris is a tiny building, its construction owing more to the collection habits of its occupant than any blueprint - none of the walls are the same height, the roof looks as if it was borrowed from the hull of a ferry and the oval door bears a definite resemblance to a dining hall table, yet the joints are tightly mortared, the building bears a fresh coat of whitewash and a small, well-tended garden lies along one side."],"exits":[{"to":93,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":205,"x":-740,"y":-680,"z":0,"title":"Steelclaw Clan, Great Hall","descriptions":["Battle standards, representing kin guilds and victories, hang from the plaster and beam ceiling that arches a full two stories overhead.  Brightly lit by torches placed at regular intervals along the walls, it is whispered that the floor was laid by Jainder Blackarm himself.  At the far end of the room, requiring visitors to walk the length of the hall to approach it, stands an immense chair.  Whoever occupies the chair inherits Jainder's legacy and rules the Clan and Guild."],"exits":[{"to":106,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":206,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"}],"color":"#FF8000","aliases":["GL Barbarian","T'Kiel","RS Barbarian"]},
  {"id":206,"x":-740,"y":-700,"z":0,"title":"Steelclaw Clan, Dancing Pit","descriptions":["Long generations of Barbarians have used the Dancing pit to test and demonstrate their skills against their guild kin.  Clean sand fills the pit, which is twelve strides in diameter and two knuckle lengths in depth as mandated by tradition and is kept raked mirror smooth by the pit master.  Long low benches, stacked several high, fill the rest of the room and allow rare and special guests to observe the matches."],"exits":[{"to":205,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"}],"aliases":["Dancing Pit","Yutwian"]},
  {"id":207,"x":-780,"y":-580,"z":0,"title":"The Broken Blade Tavern","descriptions":["Thick fragrant rushes on the floor, large comfortable rooms, clean tables and the broadest selection of ales in the province explain why the Broken Blade is famed for both its hospitality and the brewing skills of its proprietor, Amechra Tushise.  Weary off-duty guards sit swapping stories and mild insults over a pitcher of Amechra's finest at the far end of the immense bar while, at nearby tables, traders ply local merchants with whiskey in an attempt to squeeze the last gold dokora from their contracts."],"exits":[{"to":208,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"},{"to":99,"exit":"go","move":"go doorway"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Broken Blade Tavern","Amechra"]},
  {"id":208,"x":-790,"y":-590,"z":0,"title":"The Broken Blade, Hallway","descriptions":["A gleaming brass handrail, Amechra's pride and joy, provides support for his less than steady clientele as they traverse the short hallway to their rooms."],"exits":[{"to":211,"exit":"go","move":"go linwood door"},{"to":210,"exit":"go","move":"go green door"},{"to":207,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stairs"},{"to":209,"exit":"go","move":"go arched door"}]},
  {"id":209,"x":-800,"y":-600,"z":0,"title":"The Broken Blade, Ishar's Suite","descriptions":["A tiny sitting area, an overstuffed chair and table, just barely qualifies this room for its designation as a suite yet it still manages to be comfortable and inviting.  Lace curtains flutter softly at the window, tapestries cover the walls adding splashes of color and a featherbed, easily large enough for three, occupies the remainder of the room."],"exits":[{"to":208,"exit":"go","move":"go arched door"}]},
  {"id":210,"x":-780,"y":-600,"z":0,"title":"The Broken Blade, Corner Room","descriptions":["Placed where the sloping roof meets an outside wall, the low oak-beamed ceiling is a rather tricky hazard to the tavern's taller guests.  Insuring that bare feet won't grow cold, an oversized hooked rug covers the floor and a carved ash rocker sits near a pot-bellied stove.  Pushed against the far wall, a brass frame daybed, covered with fat pillows, sits awaiting a tired body."],"exits":[{"to":208,"exit":"go","move":"go green door"}]},
  {"id":211,"x":-800,"y":-580,"z":0,"title":"The Broken Blade, The Bear's Den","descriptions":["The plaster walls of this room have been painted with beautiful murals depicting various alpine scenes.  On one wall, bear cubs play in an open meadow surrounded by tall pine trees.  On another, a full grown bear fishes in a stream.  Carved wooden shutters cover the window."],"exits":[{"to":208,"exit":"go","move":"go linwood door"}]},
  {"id":212,"x":-730,"y":-580,"z":0,"title":"Steelclaw Clan, Granzer's Repairs","descriptions":["The forge of Mastersmith Granzer Wothhome is a model of efficiency and industry.  Assistants scurry about, keeping the fires stoked and at peak temperature, while the smith himself, a whipcord Elven man with a commanding presence, shapes the steel that comes hot from the forge."],"exits":[{"to":100,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Granzer's Repairs","Alternate Repairs"]},
  {"id":213,"x":-670,"y":-510,"z":0,"title":"Struan's Weapons and Armor, Salesroom","descriptions":["The Dwarven weaponsmith Struan Arguye keeps careful watch over the shop that sells his creations.  The inside of the shop is filled with cheery candlelight that reflects from the walls and the white bearskins covering the floor.  A large circle, clear of all obstructions, is set up to allow patrons to practice with an unsharpened version of the weapon they are interested in before buying."],"exits":[{"to":214,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":96,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Struan's Weapons and Armor","Armor","Weapons"]},
  {"id":214,"x":-680,"y":-510,"z":0,"title":"Struan's Weapons and Armor, Closet","descriptions":["Small and rather dark, this room appears to store Struan's work samples.  Neatly stacked hilts, blunted swords, roughly carved shapes and experimental shields provide an intriguing treasure trove of weaponry."],"exits":[{"to":213,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":215,"x":-660,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Shard, North City Gates","descriptions":["The massive gates of the city of Shard rise up to the north.  The twin doors of steel-braced ironwood give access to the North Bridge across the Lake of Tears.  Somber guards watch on the battlements above."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":0,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":0,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":70,"exit":"go","move":"go city gate"}],"aliases":["Shard","N Gate","North Gate","ngate"],"linksTo":"Map67_Shard.xml"},
  {"id":216,"x":-460,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Shard, East City Gates","descriptions":["The Eastern Gate is the second most active entrance for the thriving trade of Shard.  The looming presence of the Tower of Brickwell dominates the view to the north, a multitude of pennants emblazoned with the arms of many kingdoms, baronies, and other sovereign states flying from its battlements and marking it indelibly as the staging grounds for the Shard Trader's Guild.","Flames from smoky torches mounted on the city's walls flutter in a lakeside breeze and throw a fitful light over the ground, casting shadows on the Eastern Gate.  The shadowy outline of the Tower of Brickwell rises up to the north, the faint sound of snapping cloth coming from the Keep's direction."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":0,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":0,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":44,"exit":"go","move":"go city gate"}],"aliases":["E Gate","East Gate","egate"],"linksTo":"Map67_Shard.xml"},
  {"id":217,"x":-680,"y":-300,"z":0,"title":"Shard, Northwestern Shore","descriptions":["A muddy path wends its way amidst the reeds which border the shore of the Lake of Tears.  To the southeast, the towers of Shard loom above the city walls, gleaming as brightly as a paladin's soul."],"exits":[{"to":65,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":0,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"aliases":["W Gate","West Gate","wgate"],"linksTo":"Map69_Shard_West_Gate.xml"},
  {"id":218,"x":-220,"y":-940,"z":0,"title":"Gondola, Cab South","descriptions":["Dark brown stains have worked their way into the wooden floor and seats of this small cab, griming up the windows so that the light comes in as a ruddy, dirty color.  The faintest trace of some sweetly-sick metallic scent lingers here, just barely detectable, but inescapable.  The fresh mountain air tries to push through the sour smell, but the stench remains.","Mottled stains are worked into the wooden floor and seats of this small cab, darkening the windows to a thick black opacity.  A spike of chill taints the air, the thinnest strand of some sickly-sweet metallic scent wrapping it."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":156,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"linksTo":"Map998_Transports.xml"},
  {"id":221,"x":-580,"y":-400,"z":0,"title":"Eastern Fields, Path","descriptions":["A dirt path draws a graceful line through knee-high grasses.  A low stile provides easy access through a simply but beautifully carved wooden fence, which borders a road to the west.  Grain fields, like a placid lake of green-gold ripples, spread out to the south from east to west as far as the eye cares to wander."],"exits":[{"to":222,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":80,"exit":"climb","move":"climb low stile"}]},
  {"id":222,"x":-560,"y":-400,"z":0,"title":"Eastern Fields, Path","descriptions":["The level path curves gently around a wind-carved boulder.  The fields are laid out in such a manner as to avoid the huge rock, since its smooth planes and odd curves make it a perfect ornament for its setting.  Its rightness here in this place is so obvious that none of the farmers would have even considered removing it."],"exits":[{"to":223,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":221,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":223,"x":-560,"y":-380,"z":0,"title":"Eastern Fields, Path","descriptions":["A light breeze sets the grain fields to rustling in the darkness.  One can almost fancy that they're whispering to each other.  There's a sense of life all about, gathered and communing in the darkness -- alien, but in no way malevolent.","A light breeze sends rolling waves through the grain fields and sets the stalks waving like upraised arms, as if the grain was worshipping the sun that gives them life."],"exits":[{"to":222,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":224,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":224,"x":-560,"y":-360,"z":0,"title":"Eastern Fields, Path","descriptions":["An eerie quiet hangs over the swaying fields.  No birds call, no insects hum and even the rustling of the grain can be barely heard.  It's a waiting quiet, though, as though the moment will soon be right for -- something."],"exits":[{"to":223,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":225,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":227,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":635,"exit":"go","move":"go gateway"}],"aliases":["Boggles"]},
  {"id":225,"x":-560,"y":-340,"z":0,"title":"Eastern Fields, Path","descriptions":["A fallow field lies to the south.  All the way to the far horizon, stray heads of grain share the land with brush, wildflowers and vines.  The medley of colors and textures celebrates the reclaiming of this land by nature.  Some day the farmers will return and end the idyll with plow and harrow, but for now the meadow rejoices, dressed in its colorful best."],"exits":[{"to":224,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":226,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":226,"x":-560,"y":-320,"z":0,"title":"Fallow Field","descriptions":["No plow has sliced the ground here for a long time, nor has sickle reaped the grain.  The growth is lush, lending an overwhelming sense of life.  Nature seems to call from every direction, and the colors and aromas and vividness of life make the world spin until one no longer knows which way is which."],"exits":[{"to":225,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":0,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":0,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":0,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":0,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":0,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":0,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":0,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"aliases":["Fallow Field"]},
  {"id":227,"x":-580,"y":-360,"z":0,"title":"Gweld Path","descriptions":["The area is surrounded by large fir trees that block all light from the sun when it is shining.  Maiden's Tress vines circle the trees covering most of the valuable bark.  Small unknown bushes line a thin path making it difficult to move easily."],"exits":[{"to":224,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":228,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":228,"x":-600,"y":-360,"z":0,"title":"Gweld Path","descriptions":["A large wall covered in vines blocks any movement to the west.  Numerous ant trails cover the wall and the vines.  Sickly-green ants move up and down the trails with high efficiency carrying small bits of leaves."],"exits":[{"to":227,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":229,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":229,"x":-620,"y":-360,"z":0,"title":"Gweld Path, Temple Entrance","descriptions":["The inside of the temple is dark and foreboding.  Steps covered in a blood-red moss lead upwards to an obfuscous arch.  Worn statues of beheaded animals form a crude circle in the middle.  The heads of the statues are piled in a corner surrounded by a large black ring."],"exits":[{"to":230,"exit":"go","move":"go stair"}]},
  {"id":230,"x":-600,"y":-380,"z":0,"title":"Gweld Path, Temple","descriptions":["Cobwebs of a gigantic size cover the entire room.  No light enters, but you are able to see.  Peering closely you are barely able to make out a chair with what appears to be an old man sitting nonchalantly on it.  As you move you hear a crunching sound and realize you are standing on ashes."],"exits":[{"to":227,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":231,"x":-240,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Froissart's Tannery, The Supply Room","descriptions":["The supply room projects an air of quiet efficiency when Froissart is away and hectic activity when he's present.  Bottles, paper patterns, and tools stand neatly arranged on shelves that line the room behind a polished wooden counter.  Placed squarely in the center of the counter is a vellum catalog."],"exits":[{"to":32,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Froissart's Tannery","Tannery"]},
  {"id":232,"x":-280,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Survivalist Supplies, Front Room","descriptions":["Fragrant pine boughs hang to the ground, sheltering this quiet space from the elements.  Flickering light from a fire crackling in a stone-lined pit sends dancing reflections against the forest-green curtain that divides the trunk into a cozy semicircle.  Comfortable but businesslike, every spare corner of the room is jumbled with equipment suspended from hooks and pegs on the walls or stacked neatly on chests and cabinets crafted from sturdy oak and knotted pine."],"exits":[{"to":31,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":33,"exit":"go","move":"go green curtain"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Survivalist Supplies"]},
  {"id":233,"x":-300,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Tremagis's Furs, Showroom","descriptions":["The acrid scent of curing vats and tallow reeks in the air here, a heavenly perfume to people like Tremagis, who runs the commercial furmongering in Shard from his workshop in the next room over.  Trophies of his handiwork in the form of stretched, soft doeskin and stiff worked fur shells hang on the walls, all but covering them."],"exits":[{"to":234,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":31,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}]},
  {"id":234,"x":-300,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Tremagis's Furs, Furmongering","descriptions":["Stacks of cured hides and the stench of uncured ones fills this small back room.  Tremagis, the furrier who runs this establishment, growls and grumbles as the local trappers and hunters arrive with their furs to exchange for coins."],"exits":[{"to":233,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Tremagis's Furs","Bundles"]},
  {"id":235,"x":-360,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"Catherine's Court, Exterior","descriptions":["A two-story stone mansion rests here in a plot of well-trimmed hedges and perfectly shorn grass.  Green vines draped with blood-red iera flowers climb the trellises and wind about granite gargoyles standing sentinel from their second-story perches, tickling the beasts' stony chins in a vain attempt to awaken them from their slumber."],"exits":[{"to":53,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":53,"exit":"go","move":"go wrought-iron bridge"},{"to":236,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"}]},
  {"id":236,"x":-340,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Catherine's Court, Entrance Hall","descriptions":["Tall stained glass windows paint the checkered stone floor in colorful pools of light that spill down from above.  A large bronze chandelier hangs down from the high half-timbered ceiling, its sconces filled with fresh candles.  Tapestry chairs set beside a small fireplace in one corner if the hall offer respite, while two carved limestone arches leading east and west beckon visitors into the stately country home. ","A large bronze chandelier hangs down from the high half-timbered ceiling, its flickering candles filling the room with a warm glow.  Tapestry chairs set beside a crackling fireplace offer a place of respite, while two carved limestone arches leading east and west beckon visitors further into the reaches of this stately country home.","Tall stained glass windows paint the checkered stone floor in colorful pools of light that spill down from above.  A large bronze chandelier hangs down from the high half-timbered ceiling, its sconces filled with fresh candles.  Tapestry chairs set beside a small fireplace in one corner if the hall offer respite, while two carved limestone arches leading east and west beckon visitors into the stately country home."],"exits":[{"to":241,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":237,"exit":"go","move":"go west arch"},{"to":242,"exit":"go","move":"go east arch"},{"to":235,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"},{"to":246,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stone staircase"}],"aliases":["Catherine's Court"]},
  {"id":237,"x":-360,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Catherine's Court, West Wing","descriptions":["The stone walls of the hall soar to groined arches where pewter oil lamps hang down to illuminate the hallway.  The sweet smell of jasmine drifts along the corridor from vases of blue flowers set on marble consoles.  Above each of the consoles hangs a large gilt-framed portrait bearing the images of noble lords and ladies of the family.  Plush indigo carpeting leads down the long hall, past the doors of private suites."],"exits":[{"to":238,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":236,"exit":"go","move":"go limestone arch"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":238,"x":-380,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Catherine's Court, West Wing","descriptions":["Carved and inlaid wainscot chairs sit neatly spaced between doors leading off the hallway.  On the outside corner of the corridor, a burnished suit of plate armor stands at attention before a cluster of stained glass windows partially overgrown with the ivy that creeps up the exterior walls."],"exits":[{"to":239,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":237,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":239,"x":-380,"y":-260,"z":0,"title":"Catherine's Court, West Wing","descriptions":["An intricately carved brass jardiniere spilling over with dried sprigs of jasmine and tin eku sits between two doorways on one side of the hall.  Across from them hangs a beveled looking glass that mirrors the blue-black blossoms."],"exits":[{"to":240,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":238,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":240,"x":-380,"y":-280,"z":0,"title":"Catherine's Court, West Wing","descriptions":["Heraldic banners and pennants hang between the doors of each private suite and from the rafters of the ceiling above, a great waterfall of bold color against the dull limestone walls and dark oaken beams.  The fabric ripples in drafts of air that blow in from the frame of a paneled oak door at the rounded far end of the hallway."],"exits":[{"to":239,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":241,"x":-340,"y":-260,"z":0,"title":"Catherine's Court, Gallery","descriptions":["Daylight streams in through two soaring bay windows swathed in a gold damask that falls to the floor in soft folds.  Heraldic tapestries hang from the balustrade of the mezzanine above.  Long refectory tables adorned with tasseled silk runners present refreshments in gilded platters and dainty crystal cups.  The portrait of a noble elven man hangs above the large hooded fireplace, looking over those who pass below or stop to sit in the plush velvet chairs.","Silvery eyes of night peek through the two soaring bay windows swathed in gold damask.  Heraldic tapestries hang from the balustrade of the mezzanine above, the woven crests barely visible in the flickering firelight.  Long refectory tables adorned with tasseled silk runners present refreshments in gilded platters and dainty crystal cups.  The portrait of a noble elven man hangs above the flickering fireplace, looking over those who pass below or stop to sit in the plush velvet chairs."],"exits":[{"to":236,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":560,"exit":"go","move":"go glass doors"}]},
  {"id":242,"x":-320,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Catherine's Court, East Wing","descriptions":["The stone walls of the hall soar to groined arches where pewter oil lamps hang down to illuminate the hallway.  A sweet floral scent drifts along the corridor from vases of crimson roses set on marble consoles.  Above each of the consoles hangs a large gilt-framed portrait bearing the images of noble lords and ladies of the family.  Plush red carpeting leads down the long hall, past the doors of private suites."],"exits":[{"to":243,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":236,"exit":"go","move":"go limestone arch"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":243,"x":-300,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Catherine's Court, East Wing","descriptions":["Intricately carved mahogany chairs covered in rich red satin brocade sit neatly spaced between the sturdy doors leading off the hallway.  On the outside corner of the corridor, white porcelain sculptures sit beneath a cluster of stained glass windows, their panes partially overgrown with the ivy that creeps up the exterior walls."],"exits":[{"to":244,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":242,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":244,"x":-300,"y":-260,"z":0,"title":"Catherine's Court, East Wing","descriptions":["A delicately painted ceramic jardiniere spilling over with fresh sprays of heather and sprig roses sits between two doorways on one side of the hall.  On the opposite wall hangs a beveled looking glass that mirrors the blood-red blossoms."],"exits":[{"to":245,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":243,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":245,"x":-300,"y":-280,"z":0,"title":"Catherine's Court, East Wing","descriptions":["A large crystal chandelier hanging above the rounded terminus of the hallway spots the dull stone walls with a million tiny rainbows of refracted light.  The crystal prisms tinkle musically with drafts of air that sneak through the frame of a carved oak door leading out to the cloister gardens.  The colored glass tympanum glows with the image of Saint Ilysia."],"exits":[{"to":244,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":560,"exit":"go","move":"go carved door"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":246,"x":-280,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Catherine's Court, Stair Landing","descriptions":["Wooden posts stand to either side of the landing, supporting the oak bannister that curls gracefully down the walls of the wide stairwell to the entrance hall.  A stained glass door on the opposite wall spills color on the dull stone floor."],"exits":[{"to":247,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":251,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":236,"exit":"climb","move":"climb limestone staircase"},{"to":255,"exit":"go","move":"go glass door"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":247,"x":-260,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Catherine's Court, Lark's Hall","descriptions":["Golden silk covers the walls of this hallway, gilding the plaster and the oak beams of the half-timbered second story.  Delicate bronze oil sconces sit evenly spread between the clusters of leaded glass windows on the eastern wall.  Near the stair landing stands the wooden banister support, an ornately carved lark figurine perched on top."],"exits":[{"to":248,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":246,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":248,"x":-240,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Catherine's Court, Lark's Hall","descriptions":["A glass dome covers an arrangement of crystallized flowers set on an inlaid press cupboard, the light sparkling off each bud like dewdrops glistening in the first light of dawn.  Pale blue violets and cream-colored roses lie woven into the long rugs that line the hallway, forming a bright field of flowers underfoot."],"exits":[{"to":249,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":247,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":249,"x":-240,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Catherine's Court, Lark's Hall","descriptions":["The aroma of violets and honeysuckle floats through the air like the soft breath of springtime, the scent coming from a wreath hung between two doors leading to private suites.  A tarnished silver gauntlet mounted to a polished mahogany base sits on the sill beneath the windows clustered on the eastern wall, a grim contrast to the genteel elegance of the corridor.  The hallway ends in a graceful oak archway that leads into a sitting room swathed in golden silk."],"exits":[{"to":248,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":250,"exit":"go","move":"go oak arch"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":250,"x":-240,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Catherine's Court, Morning Room","descriptions":["Tall windows follow the curve of the turret walls, allowing light from outside to pool onto the carpeted floor.  Pastel colors highlight the ornately carved scallop arches over each window and the shelves set into the sunny yellow walls.  A silver tray and chocolate pot gleam from atop an alabaster end table set between two elegant settees."],"exits":[{"to":254,"exit":"go","move":"go loose panel"},{"to":249,"exit":"go","move":"go oak arch"}]},
  {"id":251,"x":-300,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Catherine's Court, Owl's Hall","descriptions":["Immense tapestries woven in dusky shades covering the half-timbered walls of the hallway partially conceal the age-worn oak beams and yellowed plaster.  The dim light in the corridor shifts erratically with the flickering of pewter oil sconces set between clusters of leaded glass windows on the western wall.  Near the stair landing stands the wooden banister support, an intricately carved owl figurine perched on top."],"exits":[{"to":246,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":252,"exit":"west","move":"west"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":252,"x":-320,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Catherine's Court, Owl's Hall","descriptions":["The musty smell of old pelt rugs underlies the more pungent scent of oiled metal in this bend in the hallway.  Polished swords and painted shields gleam with startling brilliance from the dull plaster walls between the muted blue tapestries, as if to remind passers-by that the glory of conquest somehow still lingers in the heart of the manor."],"exits":[{"to":253,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":251,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":253,"x":-320,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Catherine's Court, Owl's Hall","descriptions":["Above a graceful oak archway at the end of the hallway hangs a massive black greatsword, the dark steel blade looming overhead like the thunderheads of an approaching storm.  The imposing weapon seems an odd contrast to the frail pale blue flowers of a potted sjarta bush that blooms beneath the windowsill, releasing a delicate aroma into the air."],"exits":[{"to":252,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":254,"exit":"go","move":"go oak arch"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":254,"x":-320,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Catherine's Court, Study","descriptions":["Polished oak paneling covers the walls of the windowless round room, nearly concealing bookshelves built into the curved wall behind a black leather sofa.  A parchment map hangs above the sofa, the aged paper the color of yellowed bone.  Plush velvet pillows with silver tasseled corners lie scattered on the soft snowbeast fur rug lining the stone floor of the large study."],"exits":[{"to":253,"exit":"go","move":"go oak arch"},{"to":250,"exit":"go","move":"go loose panel"}]},
  {"id":255,"x":-280,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Catherine's Court, Balcony","descriptions":["Starflower vines creeping up from the cloister garden below twine the lichen-patched stone balustrade.  Daylight spreads across the carefully manicured landscape that stretches out behind the house and ends in a rich tangle of tall trees in the distance.  Ornate brick chimneys clustered on the steeply pitched slate roofs of the east and west wings send tufts of silver smoke sailing into the pale sky."],"exits":[{"to":246,"exit":"go","move":"go glass door"}]},
  {"id":256,"x":-360,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"House of the Gilded Longleaf, Trail","descriptions":["The trail meanders around a fallen tree and several large boulders.  Wildflowers grow in sparse clumps hosting the occasional butterfly as they flit from one batch to the next.  Waving in the breeze, ribbons clearly mark the route."],"exits":[{"to":257,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":274,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":47,"exit":"go","move":"go winding trail"}],"aliases":["House of the Gilded Longleaf","Gilded Longleaf"]},
  {"id":257,"x":-480,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"House of the Gilded Longleaf, Obscure Trail","descriptions":["Trees and heavy brush crowd a game trail obscured by fallen leaves and growing ferns.  Little more than a rut in the forest floor, it gently curves to avoid a deadfall.  The forest is filled with the sound of twittering birds and the scent of pine needles."],"exits":[{"to":256,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":258,"exit":"climb","move":"climb deadfall"}]},
  {"id":258,"x":-500,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"House of the Gilded Longleaf, Encampment","descriptions":["Wagons of various sizes and shapes are spread throughout the area, with some connected by covered walkways for larger families.  Bright pink bee balm flowers grow with abundance here, attracting hummingbirds -- a favorite bird of the elders who come to watch them during the day.  Steps lead towards the main building."],"exits":[{"to":259,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":257,"exit":"go","move":"go path"},{"to":276,"exit":"go","move":"go oak steps"}]},
  {"id":259,"x":-500,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"House of the Gilded Longleaf, Wooded Trail","descriptions":["Familial wagons create small huddled circles here, the flickering light from the communal hearth warming the space.  Windowsill planters and large earthen pots filled with flowers and medicinal herbs add color and beauty to the surroundings."],"exits":[{"to":262,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":258,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":260,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":260,"x":-540,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"House of the Gilded Longleaf, Wooded Trail","descriptions":["Growing more abundantly as the trail heads northward, the trees are thick on the ground.  Very few wagons are found here, giving a sense of solitude to the area.  Several pots of bright red geraniums are placed side by side with herbs, adding both beauty and function to the portable landscaping.  The path continues toward the sound of water while a ramp heads to a forest bower."],"exits":[{"to":261,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":259,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":275,"exit":"go","move":"go ramp"}]},
  {"id":261,"x":-500,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"House of the Gilded Longleaf, Wooded Trail","descriptions":["Quiet prevails around the area save for the occasional sound of a bird singing or the rustle of the tall trees in the wind.  Long troughs of fragrant, shade-loving herbs grow abundantly in the darkness of the forest."],"exits":[{"to":262,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":260,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":263,"exit":"go","move":"go footway"}]},
  {"id":262,"x":-460,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"House of the Gilded Longleaf, Wooded Trail","descriptions":["Spread thinly here, the distant wagons add to the sense of solitude in the area.  Lavender scents the air, growing in large pots alongside other herbs.  A nearby wagon is painted a bright blue and stenciled with a colorful butterfly.  The path continues towards the sound of water."],"exits":[{"to":259,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":261,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":263,"x":-480,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"House of the Gilded Longleaf, House Garden","descriptions":["Straight and angular, the walkways evenly divide each type of plant from other varieties.  Herbs, vegetables and dwarf fruit trees abound providing more than enough food for every member of the House and any guests that may visit.  Gardeners work fastidiously at tending their charges.  A wooded path leads directly to a large building, allowing the cooks and their assistants easy access."],"exits":[{"to":261,"exit":"go","move":"go footway"},{"to":264,"exit":"go","move":"go path"}]},
  {"id":264,"x":-440,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"House of the Gilded Longleaf, Back Porch","descriptions":["Open on three sides, this simple, covered porch offers both a back entrance to the kitchen and a welcomed respite from the heat of the stove.  The boughs of wild cherry and plum trees cascade over the slatted handrails beside which two rustic benches rest.  A rough-hewn walkway leads past the meeting forum to another building in the distance while a meandering woodland path offers access to the vegetable and herb gardens."],"exits":[{"to":263,"exit":"go","move":"go path"},{"to":265,"exit":"go","move":"go curtain"},{"to":276,"exit":"go","move":"go walkway"}]},
  {"id":265,"x":-380,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"House of the Gilded Longleaf, Kitchen","descriptions":["Cooks work busily at the three tables standing in the center of the room.  With its simmering pots and whistling kettles, a round stove nestles in the corner opposite a massive whitewashed pantry.  Along the far wall, a large window and the brass lanterns flanking it offer ample light for cooking and cleaning alike.  In an attempt to vent the heat of the room, a simple curtain is pulled aside to reveal the back porch."],"exits":[{"to":264,"exit":"go","move":"go curtain"},{"to":266,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":266,"x":-380,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"House of the Gilded Longleaf, Dining Hall","descriptions":["Saffron-yellow tablecloths, cerulean cushions and delicate floral arrangements disguise the simple, low tables and benches at which meals are served in this busy common room.  Braziers have been placed along the rear wall to offer diners light and warmth as they enjoy the gentle, woodland breezes that waft in through an oversized window.  An aggressive wisteria vine winds its way through the silk-draped lattice walls, scenting the area with its heady aroma."],"exits":[{"to":267,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":265,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":267,"x":-400,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"House of the Gilded Longleaf, Foyer","descriptions":["Jaunty watercolor paintings and panels of billowing silk adorn the simple, latticed walls that enclose this winsome chamber.  Tiles of tightly-woven sisal, dyed various shades of sepia and brown, have been arranged to form a mosaic carpet that covers the slatted floor of the platform.  The room's focal point is a large, lacquered secretary that stands opposite the opening leading into a graceful pergola."],"exits":[{"to":266,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":268,"exit":"go","move":"go door"},{"to":277,"exit":"go","move":"go pergola"}]},
  {"id":268,"x":-400,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"House of the Gilded Longleaf, Veranda","descriptions":["Honeysuckle and jasmine have twined up the graceful columns that support the shallow, convex roof enclosing this welcoming portico.  Mimicking the colors of the flowering vines, a vermilion and cream floor runner stretches across the timber platform from the edge of a teak ramp to the cheerful double doors leading into the building.  Beside the doors stands a weathered statue of an Elothean woman gesturing at a bronze gong."],"exits":[{"to":269,"exit":"go","move":"go wide archway"},{"to":270,"exit":"go","move":"go teak ramp"},{"to":267,"exit":"go","move":"go double doors"}]},
  {"id":269,"x":-420,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"House of the Gilded Longleaf, Library","descriptions":["A trio of gaethzen moons hung in the center of the small room provide soft light for reading.  Pull-down coverings conceal some of the shelves that line all available wall space, and comfortable chairs are scattered about the area for late-night study.  A small desk with a sign on it sits near the exit."],"exits":[{"to":268,"exit":"go","move":"go wide archway"}]},
  {"id":270,"x":-400,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"House of the Gilded Longleaf, Front Lawn","descriptions":["Ornamental grasses grow before an eclectic structure crafted of interconnected sections capped by gently sloping roofs.  Open and airy, the building has many large, window-like openings shaded by billowing, colorful awnings.  Across from the structure is a towering longleaf pine, a flower-filled thicket wending its way south from the tree.  In the center of the clearing stands an ancient sundial."],"exits":[{"to":271,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":268,"exit":"go","move":"go teak ramp"}]},
  {"id":271,"x":-420,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"House of the Gilded Longleaf, Path","descriptions":["Amid a riot of daisies and buttercups sits a red-lacquered wooden bench.  Swarms of colorful butterflies fly over the flowers in ever-changing clouds.  An arbor, laced with blue and white flowers, interrupts the otherwise impenetrable wall of the nearby thicket."],"exits":[{"to":270,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":272,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":272,"x":-420,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"House of the Gilded Longleaf, Meadow","descriptions":["Following the thicket, the path travels through a small, overgrown meadow.  Lilac bushes fill the open area giving off their sweet, heady fragrance.  The ever-present butterflies have given way to honey bees from a nearby hive who are working tirelessly at collecting pollen.  Ribbons have been regularly placed on the bushes and thicket to mark the path."],"exits":[{"to":271,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":273,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":273,"x":-400,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"House of the Gilded Longleaf, Wooded Path","descriptions":["The maintained path follows the thicket through woods populated with pine, cedar and oak trees.  Wildflowers dominate the ground cover surrounding sweet-smelling lilac bushes.  The butterflies fly more thickly here, and the air is full of their fluttering wings.  Discreet ribbons are tied to the bushes and thicket in regular intervals to mark the way through the undergrowth."],"exits":[{"to":272,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":274,"exit":"go","move":"go path"}]},
  {"id":274,"x":-380,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"House of the Gilded Longleaf, Glade","descriptions":["Snapdragons and verbena grow in a profusion of color here, covering every inch of the ground.  Lush spicebushes nestle against the thicket which looms nearby, its brilliant orange flowers sending a siren call to the butterflies which flock to the area for miles around.  A game trail leads to the southeast and a wooded path heads north, following the thicket."],"exits":[{"to":256,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":273,"exit":"go","move":"go path"}]},
  {"id":275,"x":-500,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"House of the Gilded Longleaf, Forest Bower","descriptions":["Encircling giant ferns offer privacy to this peaceful glade while the boughs of towering trees and a simple awning offer shelter from the elements.  The gentle murmur of a nearby stream promises a restful slumber in the open air.  For that purpose, a collection of hammocks clusters around a stone firepit.  Some thoughtful soul has left jugs of spring water and a basket of freshly-baked bread near the forest-green door leading into the building."],"exits":[{"to":276,"exit":"go","move":"go door"},{"to":260,"exit":"go","move":"go ramp"}]},
  {"id":276,"x":-440,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"House of the Gilded Longleaf, Hall","descriptions":["Spacious windows allow gentle woodland breezes to carry the scents of exotic flowers and decaying leaves throughout this workroom.  The center of the hall is dominated by rows of tables that provide workspace for all manner of industry.  Silk looms and graceful easels are turned to take the greatest advantage of the light.  To the rear of the room, willow stand lamps flank a rounded alcove leading to the dormitory wing."],"exits":[{"to":277,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":264,"exit":"go","move":"go walkway"},{"to":258,"exit":"go","move":"go oak steps"},{"to":279,"exit":"go","move":"go golden door"},{"to":275,"exit":"go","move":"go forest door"},{"to":280,"exit":"go","move":"go ivory door"}]},
  {"id":277,"x":-420,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"House of the Gilded Longleaf, Remembrance Hall","descriptions":["To either side of a teak walkway, elaborate trelliswork rises from the woodland floor, creating a vast pergola under the tree canopy.  Small shrines are sheltered among the hostas, painted ferns, and bluebells that quilt the ground while a profusion of vines reaches upward along the carved beams of the enclosure.  The sound of birdcalls and the steady rhythm of a water clock are all that mar the reverent silence of the hall.  Gaps in the pergola reveal an arbored footpath."],"exits":[{"to":278,"exit":"go","move":"go footpath"},{"to":267,"exit":"go","move":"go foyer"},{"to":276,"exit":"go","move":"go carved archway"}]},
  {"id":278,"x":-460,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"House of the Gilded Longleaf, Forum","descriptions":["Little more than a large, round clearing under the canopy of several towering trees, the forum boasts two concentric rings of benches centering on the speaker's mound.  Rows of torches and embroidered pennants surround the seating area."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":277,"exit":"go","move":"go footpath"}]},
  {"id":279,"x":-420,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"House of the Gilded Longleaf, Golden Repose","descriptions":["Tiger maple paneling and a glazed glass window make this room one of the rare fully enclosed spaces in the complex.  Though the cozy chamber is modest in size, no expense has been spared to make guests feel comfortable.  A lacquered dresser, bearing an alabaster wash basin, sits opposite an overstuffed featherbed.  Beneath the small window rests a mahogany rocking chair."],"exits":[{"to":276,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":280,"x":-440,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"House of the Gilded Longleaf, White Chamber","descriptions":["The whitewashed, lattice walls of this charming room are interwoven with silver silk and accented with several lace wall hangings depicting healing herbs.  A modest featherbed is covered with matching silk linens, and a grass-green folding chair sits beside a window.  An arrangement of chysanthemums and wild ginger blossoms graces a small table next to the chair."],"exits":[{"to":276,"exit":"go","move":"go door"}]},
  {"id":281,"x":-400,"y":-560,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor","descriptions":["A strange, meticulously placed line of bones begins here, travelling to the northeast through the tall grass.  Comprised of many sizes and shapes, the bones are devoid of rotted flesh or sinew."],"exits":[{"to":388,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":199,"exit":"go","move":"go dirt path"},{"to":282,"exit":"go","move":"go bones"}],"aliases":["Darkmist Moor"]},
  {"id":282,"x":-400,"y":-400,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor, Trail of Bones","descriptions":["A strange trail of bones is scattered amidst the tall grasses, wending its through the boggy marsh.  The moor's vegetation grows a bit thicker to the east as one travels further from the road."],"exits":[{"to":283,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":284,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":281,"exit":"go","move":"go bones"}]},
  {"id":283,"x":-380,"y":-420,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor","descriptions":["The rocky ground is covered with blue-grey lichen and sturdy pale yellow weeds.  Fingers of mist whirl around a broken arrow wedged between two thin ribs of a long decayed torso.  The lower half of the skeleton lies several feet away, likely dragged by scavengers, with a single moldering boot clinging to what little is left of its owner."],"exits":[{"to":296,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":284,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":282,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":284,"x":-380,"y":-400,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor, Trail of Bones","descriptions":["Just south of the bone path, the land drops suddenly for several feet.  The earth of the slope has been disturbed in small patches, and several clumps of heather lay scattered and uprooted."],"exits":[{"to":283,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":286,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":285,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":282,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":285,"x":-360,"y":-380,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor","descriptions":["The dark green grass here is slowly losing its battle with mortality.  Patches of light brown dead grass stand out against the darker green of their surroundings.  To the southeast you can see the silhouette of a dead tree, its now bare branches reaching up as if in supplication.  Several cracked rocks litter the ground, their shattered, blackened surfaces indicating that some power other than weather and time are to blame for their state."],"exits":[{"to":286,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":287,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":284,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":286,"x":-360,"y":-400,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor, Trail of Bones","descriptions":["An ancient stump sits nearly buried in the tall grass of the moor.  Pale grey fans of some unidentifiable fungus spread from its side while specks of a scarlet mold stretch up the trunk from the roots.  In contrast to these tenacious vestiges of life, the bleached trail of bones runs past the stump and stretches to the west and northeast."],"exits":[{"to":288,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":285,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":284,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":287,"x":-340,"y":-360,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor","descriptions":["A solitary dead tree, bleached white by the sun, still reaches its limbs high above the brown, lifeless patch of earth surrounding it.  Dozens of kobold skulls hang from the branches, suspended from ropes woven from the blades of the grass that is so abundant in the moor.  A hollow knocking sound is emitted by the skulls as they swing against each other in the wind."],"exits":[{"to":285,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":288,"x":-340,"y":-420,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor, Trail of Bones","descriptions":["The grass here is trampled around a great pile of decaying remains.  Femurs, skulls and skeletal hands lie in a heap with broken weapons and bits of rotting leather armor.  The trail of bones continues to the southwest and southeast, but whatever caused this carnage appears to have paused here for some time before moving on."],"exits":[{"to":289,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":286,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":296,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":289,"x":-320,"y":-400,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor, Trail of Bones","descriptions":["The trail dips gently into a fog-filled depression.  A small underground spring trickles from the rocks, making the ground along the trail spongy and wet.  The damp mist clings to everything, muffling sound and limiting sight to a few yards in any direction."],"exits":[{"to":290,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":291,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":288,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":290,"x":-300,"y":-420,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor, Trail of Bones","descriptions":["A flat grey rock stretches across the path, briefly interrupting the gruesome ivory trail.  The tall dark green grass moves slightly in a gentle breeze, providing the only sign of life in this otherwise still expanse.  Off to one side, a decaying kobold head sits atop a crudely carved post -- a sacrifice, perhaps, or a warning."],"exits":[{"to":295,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":289,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":291,"x":-300,"y":-400,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor","descriptions":["Pale yellow weeds compete with the grass of the moor for the dim sunlight that filters through the mist.  A small patch of briars curls its thorny fingers over a large rock jutting from the ground.  To the east, the mist thickens into a dense fog, while to the south, the moor can be seen stretching away with only the occasional tree to mark the distance.","Pale yellow weeds intermingle with the damp grasses of the moor.  A small patch of briars curls its thorny fingers over a large rock jutting from the ground.  To the east, the mist thickens into a dense fog, while to the south, the moor can be seen stretching away with only the occasional tree to mark the distance."],"exits":[{"to":294,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":292,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":289,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":292,"x":-320,"y":-380,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor","descriptions":["A half-buried boulder interrupts the game trail, its jagged surface covered in more of the blue-grey lichen that seems to flourish on the rocks of the grassland.  A rusted spearhead wedged deeply into the stone attests to the violence that once swept over this area."],"exits":[{"to":291,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":293,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":293,"x":-300,"y":-360,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor","descriptions":["Crushed grass and a broken sword half buried in the ground give evidence of a violent struggle some time ago, though what became of the combatants remains a mystery.  A game trail loops from the northeast and northwest, but little else of note is apparent in the sea of grass rolling out in all directions.  Even the gentle rustling of the grass is muted by the dampness of the air."],"exits":[{"to":294,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":292,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":294,"x":-280,"y":-380,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor","descriptions":["A gnarled tree huddles in the grass.  Its branches have been peppered with small arrows, and claw marks scar the trunk.  Within the branches, the dull glint of a helm can be spotted through the leaves.  Whatever creature it was that sought safety in the tree's arms apparently did not find it here."],"exits":[{"to":293,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":291,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":295,"x":-280,"y":-420,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor, Trail of Bones","descriptions":["A small hip bone juts from beneath one of several low bushes that grow clumped together several feet from the trail of bones.  Amidst the long sharp thorns and tiny bright red berries rests a long solitary branch, its bark darker and more coarse than the bushes' slender stems."],"exits":[{"to":290,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":296,"x":-360,"y":-440,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor","descriptions":["An uprooted tree lies on its side, surrounded by broken branches and pieces of bark.  A patch of blackened earth on the leeward side of the tree tells of at least one campfire built from its remains.  Trampled grass makes paths to the southwest and southeast leading from the tree."],"exits":[{"to":288,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":283,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":297,"x":-240,"y":-500,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor, Secluded Shrine","descriptions":["Shrouded in dark purple mist, a tall ebony altar rises from the overgrown grass.  A collection of hideous gargoyles stands sentry in a macabre circle around the shrine, sneering inward at the scarred monolith."],"exits":[{"to":394,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#A6A3D9","aliases":["Shrine3-3","Secluded Shrine","Harawep"]},
  {"id":298,"x":-140,"y":-480,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor, Tamsine's Sorrow","descriptions":["The mists grow denser eastward, roiling together into a thick pall that obscures any pathway in the heavy darkness.  Spindly bushes barren of leaves randomly claw their way upwards."],"exits":[{"to":399,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":299,"exit":"east","move":"script peerchurch"},{"to":299,"exit":"southeast","move":"script peerchurch"},{"to":300,"exit":"climb","move":"climb scraggly tree"}],"aliases":["Tamsine's Sorrow"]},
  {"id":299,"x":-120,"y":-480,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor, Dirt Road","descriptions":["The ground slopes along the sides of a simple dirt road meandering northward from the thin mists.  Delightfully earthy smells of dust and wildlife punctuate the crisp fresh air.  A small white building sits quietly at the side of an abandoned road."],"exits":[{"to":298,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":301,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}]},
  {"id":300,"x":-140,"y":-520,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor, Scraggly Treetop","descriptions":["The age-worn tree lofts its branches just above the heavy pall of mist, offering a clear vantage of the surrounding terrain.  A simple whitewashed church contrasts starkly against the darkness of the countryside to the east, an odd sight amidst so much gloom.","The age-worn tree lofts its branches just above the heavy pall of mist, offering a clear vantage of the surrounding terrain.  A simple whitewashed church nestles in the green countryside to the east, an odd sight amidst so much gloom."],"exits":[{"to":298,"exit":"climb","move":"climb trunk"}]},
  {"id":301,"x":-100,"y":-500,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor, Country Church","descriptions":["A small rustic church, with an overhanging roof and rough-hewn wooden pillars, watches solemnly over the area.  Ivory-white paint is flaking and peeling from its walls, which are embraced by creeping vines of deep green ivy."],"exits":[{"to":299,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":302,"exit":"go","move":"go country church"}],"aliases":["Country Church"]},
  {"id":302,"x":-80,"y":-500,"z":0,"title":"Country Church, Church Foyer","descriptions":["Though this narrow vestibule is small, it is crowned by a lovely high ceiling from which dangles the remains of a shattered chandelier.  Its walls are lined with old, faded portraits smudged with dirt."],"exits":[{"to":303,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":301,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":303,"x":-80,"y":-520,"z":0,"title":"Country Church, Main Hall","descriptions":["One large room comprises the church's sanctuary.  Simple pine pews line both sides of a tiny center aisle that leads to an altar to the north.  Small stained glass windows depicting woodland scenes adorn the walls on either side of the pews."],"exits":[{"to":304,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":302,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":305,"exit":"go","move":"go short hallway"}]},
  {"id":304,"x":-80,"y":-540,"z":0,"title":"Country Church, Altar","descriptions":["All that adorns this understated altar is a faded white linen cloth.  The wooden planks underfoot are well worn from years of use, and they creak softly with each shift of weight."],"exits":[{"to":303,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":306,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"},{"to":305,"exit":"go","move":"go archway"}],"color":"#800080","aliases":["Phelim"]},
  {"id":305,"x":-60,"y":-540,"z":0,"title":"Country Church, Short Hallway","descriptions":["Barely five feet long, this short hallway is separated from the sanctuary by a gracefully carved railing, leading to a narrow alcove at its eastern end."],"exits":[{"to":308,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":304,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":309,"exit":"go","move":"go white door"}]},
  {"id":306,"x":-100,"y":-540,"z":0,"title":"Country Church, Cleric's Office","descriptions":["Barely furnished, this quiet office was designed for resident clerics to prepare for ceremonies.  A small table with a matching chair is pushed against one wall."],"exits":[{"to":307,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":304,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden door"}]},
  {"id":307,"x":-120,"y":-540,"z":0,"title":"Country Church, Cloakroom","descriptions":["Ornate brass hooks adorn the walls where clerical vestments once hung.  The air is hot and choked with dust thanks to the lack of any appreciable ventilation."],"exits":[{"to":306,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":308,"x":-40,"y":-540,"z":0,"title":"Country Church, Statue Alcove","descriptions":["A tall wooden statue of Hodierna stands resolutely upon a painted column, staring blankly ahead.  There is an inherent darkness in this corner of the church, which cloaks the details of the architecture and bathes the mirthless statue in perpetual gloom."],"exits":[{"to":305,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":309,"x":-60,"y":-560,"z":0,"title":"Country Church, Back Porch","descriptions":["Cracked and splintered boards, making a poor excuse for a porch, lead to a faded white door at the back of this forlorn little church.  A dirt path runs parallel to the damaged planks, leading northwest toward a cemetery."],"exits":[{"to":310,"exit":"go","move":"go dirt path"},{"to":305,"exit":"go","move":"go white door"}]},
  {"id":310,"x":-120,"y":-620,"z":0,"title":"Country Church, Cemetery Approach","descriptions":["A rickety porch nestled in the overgrown grasses of the moor provides entry to the back door of the dilapidated old church.  A scraggly dirt path heavily draped with weeds meanders northeast, approaching a long-forgotten cemetery."],"exits":[{"to":311,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":309,"exit":"go","move":"go rickety porch"}]},
  {"id":311,"x":-100,"y":-640,"z":0,"title":"Country Church, Cemetery Gate","descriptions":["Shattered remnants of an ancient iron gate flank the faint dirt pathway to either side, no longer hindering passage into the cemetery.  Thick weeds and vines slither into the once intricate latticework, vying for a higher perch on which to bask."],"exits":[{"to":312,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":310,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":312,"x":-80,"y":-660,"z":0,"title":"Country Church, Cemetery","descriptions":["Visible a short distance to the south, a modest mausoleum of grey granite rises out of the grassy moor.  The weed-ridden dirt pathway snakes eastward, making a wide arc through the cemetery and around to the structure."],"exits":[{"to":313,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":311,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":313,"x":0,"y":-660,"z":0,"title":"Country Church, Cemetery","descriptions":["A faint dirt path wends southeast through a morbid garden of weatherworn tombstones.  Scraggly grasses push up through the ground above the ancient plots, creeping their way across the path."],"exits":[{"to":314,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":312,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":314,"x":20,"y":-640,"z":0,"title":"Country Church, Cemetery","descriptions":["The dirt path bends sharply at the foot of a haggard hangman's tree, which bows beneath the weight of the souls it has reaped.  Several large stones scattered amidst the weeds and grass form erratic patterns."],"exits":[{"to":315,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":313,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":315,"x":-40,"y":-580,"z":0,"title":"Country Church, Cemetery","descriptions":["Monstrous gargoyles herald your approach to the granite mausoleum to the northwest, sneering wickedly at those that cross the dusty dirt path.  An ornate gold-veined marble tombstone lurches out of the ground just south of the path, marking the resting place of some noble of long ago."],"exits":[{"to":314,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":316,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":316,"x":-60,"y":-580,"z":0,"title":"Country Church, Before Mausoleum","descriptions":["The faint path turns into a round patch of grassless dirt before a pair of great obsidian doors that safeguard entrance to the grey granite mausoleum.  Unlike the rest of the pathway, the dirt here is free of the omnipresent weeds and grass, as if recent movement had discouraged their growth.  Gargoyles perched within high niches flanking the doors leer ominously down at all below."],"exits":[{"to":315,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":402,"exit":"go","move":"go obsidian doors"}],"aliases":["Mausoleum"]},
  {"id":317,"x":-40,"y":-820,"z":0,"title":"Dragon's Spine, Behind the Waterfall","descriptions":["Footing becomes quite treacherous here as each new step brings forth more uncertainty.  Tiny rivulets of icy water trickle down from the waterfall and freeze, adding to the already slippery sheet of ice on the ground.  The more adventurous traveler might either chance the dark woodlands ahead or ferret out some way to penetrate and attempt to swim the frozen river.  The less daring of souls will quickly retreat from whence they came."],"exits":[{"to":163,"exit":"go","move":"go crack"},{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":"go wood"}],"aliases":["Waterfall","Undergondola"],"linksTo":"Map65_Under_the_Gondola.xml"},
  {"id":318,"x":-380,"y":-600,"z":0,"title":"Shrine to the Dragon, A Dank Passage","descriptions":["Streams of light trickle over some uneven jade stairs to the north.  A passage westward leads towards the rest of the shrine."],"exits":[{"to":319,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":201,"exit":"climb","move":"climb jade stairs"}]},
  {"id":319,"x":-400,"y":-600,"z":0,"title":"Shrine to the Dragon, A Dank Passage","descriptions":["The murals that were once here have long since faded from the walls, leaving behind broken plaster and crumbling stone as their remain.  The only apparent exit lies east."],"exits":[{"to":318,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":320,"exit":"go","move":"search go onyx arch"}]},
  {"id":320,"x":-400,"y":-620,"z":0,"title":"Shrine to the Dragon, Central Chamber","descriptions":["This chamber is carved directly into the stone of the caverns.  The walls are a dark green jade, encircling a stained altar that rests in the very center.  Statues, shattered and smashed by time and angry mortal hands alike, stand forever frozen in broken dances.  Elegant brass sconces still flicker with mystic lights, dim but bright enough to illuminate the area."],"exits":[{"to":321,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stone stairs"},{"to":319,"exit":"go","move":"go onyx arch"}],"color":"#400040","aliases":["Shrine3-2","Dragon","Depart"]},
  {"id":321,"x":-380,"y":-640,"z":0,"title":"Jade Cavern, Vestibule","descriptions":["Elaborate stone carvings arch overhead, twisting into fascinating shapes.  Tall columns crafted from translucent jade flank the walls that lead further west into the heart of the caverns."],"exits":[{"to":322,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":320,"exit":"climb","move":"climb stone stairs"}]},
  {"id":322,"x":-400,"y":-640,"z":0,"title":"Jade Cavern, Dark Passage","descriptions":["The walls are gouged and scratched, chunks of rock ripped from the once-polished and painted murals.  Fragments of tile lie shattered on the floor, crunching at the lightest touch."],"exits":[{"to":321,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":323,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":323,"x":-420,"y":-640,"z":0,"title":"Jade Cavern, Small Opening","descriptions":["Luminescent walls of rough green jade curve around you, the cupped, smooth hands of the earth.  A path chisled into the stone floor leads east."],"exits":[{"to":322,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":324,"x":100,"y":-600,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Descent, Altar of the Flesh","descriptions":["The smooth onyx floor has been shattered by thick, muscular roots pushing upward.  The roots intertwine into a contorted mass in the center of the hall.  The stench of burning flesh rises from the strange altar, yet no fire is visible."],"exits":[{"to":325,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":347,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Altar of the Flesh","Flesh"]},
  {"id":325,"x":120,"y":-620,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Descent, Hall of the Flesh","descriptions":["Muted light from the southwest casts dark wavering images on the unblemished onyx wall and bounces to the neighboring wall.  Further shadows shimmer eerily on the polished floor, resembling writhing bodies caught in the throes of a painful death."],"exits":[{"to":326,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":324,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":326,"x":140,"y":-640,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Descent, Onyx Corridor","descriptions":["A wavering torch secured in a solid stone funnel is solidly fused into the glossy onyx wall near the high ceiling.  Occasional wafts of air cause the flame to twist slowly, an imitation of an ominous dance of the macabre."],"exits":[{"to":327,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":325,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":327,"x":160,"y":-660,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Descent, Onyx Corridor","descriptions":["The smooth, glossy finish of the onyx walls is unbroken.  The passage seems brighter to the southwest, where filtered light seeps into the room, reflecting eerie shadows on the polished surface."],"exits":[{"to":328,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":326,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":328,"x":180,"y":-680,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Descent, Onyx Corridor","descriptions":["Surrounded on all sides by smooth lustrous onyx walls, the enclosed environment lends the impression of being entombed in a box of solid rock.  Occasionally a glimmer of light will reflect dully across the unblemished surfaces, causing a brief moment of vertigo."],"exits":[{"to":329,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":327,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":329,"x":200,"y":-700,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Descent, Hall of the Soul","descriptions":["Sinister frescoes adorn the northern wall of this cavernous hall, where the dichotomy of the silver and onyx hallways merges into one.  The ceiling is a sweeping arch of black crystal, supported by pillars of darkly veined jade.  A twisting hallway with verdant malachite walls winds to the south."],"exits":[{"to":334,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":330,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":328,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":330,"x":200,"y":-680,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Descent, Hall of the Soul","descriptions":["Irregular formations of malachite create a treacherous cavern that winds in an erratic serpentine pattern to the south.  The air is crisp, cold, and fresh, with no hint of the musty pall draped over the rest of the ancient temple."],"exits":[{"to":329,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":331,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":331,"x":200,"y":-660,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Descent, Hall of the Soul","descriptions":["The icy air carries the faint tinkling of off-key wind chimes that echoes eerily through the dark malachite tunnel.  As one travels southerly down the hall, the temperature seems to drop rapidly."],"exits":[{"to":330,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":332,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":332,"x":200,"y":-640,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Descent, Hall of the Soul","descriptions":["A thin layer of frost coats the malachite formations, while slender icicles jab downward into the hall.  Vapor crystallizes with every breath, each a wraith of former life captured forever by the cruel clutches of the temple's heart."],"exits":[{"to":331,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":333,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":333,"x":200,"y":-620,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Descent, Altar of the Soul","descriptions":["The ice-laden floor suddenly gives way to an enormous chasm to the south.  Tendrils of intricate silver writhe out from the dusky malachite walls, intertwining to form a strange altar just before the lip of the gaping chasm.  Far in the distance to the south, a glimmering crystalline dais hovers inexplicably over the great pit."],"exits":[{"to":332,"exit":"north","move":"north"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Altar of the Soul","Soul"]},
  {"id":334,"x":220,"y":-680,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Descent, Silver Corridor","descriptions":["Smooth and deathly cold to the touch, the silver walls are free of any markings.  A pale luminance from the northwest seems to beckon the unwary traveler."],"exits":[{"to":335,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":329,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":335,"x":240,"y":-660,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Descent, Silver Corridor","descriptions":["Silver walls, their smooth surface polished to a glossy finish, refract the dim light invading menacingly from the southeast.  Odd reflections bounce between the polished surfaces, causing a moment of dizziness that quickly passes."],"exits":[{"to":336,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":334,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":336,"x":260,"y":-640,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Descent, Silver Corridor","descriptions":["An old lantern, its finish blackened from years of use, hangs from a silver hook embedded in the passageway's ceiling.  Nefarious shadows, resembling malformed beings, flitter gruesomely on the silver walls as subtle air currents cause the lantern to sway ominously."],"exits":[{"to":337,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":335,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":337,"x":280,"y":-620,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Descent, Hall of the Mind","descriptions":["Dim light filtering eerily from the southeast allows enough luminance to see that the passage continues.  The silvery walls are slick and cold to the touch."],"exits":[{"to":338,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":336,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":338,"x":300,"y":-600,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Descent, Altar of the Mind","descriptions":["The silver walls take on a brilliant emerald hue, painted by the light emanating from a makeshift altar formed from a massive block of green crystal set upon two egg-shaped stones.  The faint murmuring of foreign prayers echoes on the edge of aural perception, yet nags incessantly at your mind.  The alcove is barren of embellishments, accentuating the austerity of its reflective walls."],"exits":[{"to":339,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":337,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"color":"#00FF00","aliases":["Altar of the Mind","Mind"]},
  {"id":339,"x":280,"y":-580,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Descent, Hall of the Mind","descriptions":["Faint light from the northeast casts grim shadows on the glossy silver walls, illuminating the dark passage slightly.  The polished mirror-like surface of each wall reflects distorted impressions of the moving images it captures."],"exits":[{"to":338,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":340,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":340,"x":260,"y":-560,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Descent, Silver Corridor","descriptions":["Silver walls, shrouded with lines of faint luminance from the southwest, stretch upwards to a smooth metallic ceiling.  This refracted light seems to move of its own volition, converging into long, silvery tendrils that creep deeply into the darker recesses of the wide corridor."],"exits":[{"to":339,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":341,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":341,"x":240,"y":-540,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Descent, Silver Corridor","descriptions":["A sputtering torch is nested securely in a conical silver bracket attached to a corner near the ceiling.  The reflected image of the torch is mirrored upon two of the glossy silver walls and ceiling, its wavering likeness shimmering unendingly against the polished surface."],"exits":[{"to":340,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":342,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":342,"x":220,"y":-520,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Descent, Silver Corridor","descriptions":["Smooth silver walls, with an identical ceiling and floor, form a glossy passageway to greet the unwary traveler.  Random echoes of light glaze the shiny surfaces like skeletal hands scraping long bony fingers across a polished mirror."],"exits":[{"to":341,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":343,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":343,"x":200,"y":-500,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Descent, Entry Hall","descriptions":["This great hall features vaulted walls of dark crystal and an inlaid floor of green-veined marble.  A faint, spiritual chanting converges from every which direction, buoyed by frigid air."],"exits":[{"to":342,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":348,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":344,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":344,"x":180,"y":-520,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Descent, Onyx Corridor","descriptions":["High onyx walls line a featureless passageway along whose mirror-like surfaces a shock of light occasionally crackles to show travelers the way."],"exits":[{"to":343,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":345,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":345,"x":160,"y":-540,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Descent, Onyx Corridor","descriptions":["A rusted iron lamp swings precariously from the vaulted onyx ceiling, disturbed by a strong breeze.  The erratic flicker cast from above draws ever-shifting apparitions of shadow on the smooth onyx walls, leaving one to wonder what is real and what is illusion."],"exits":[{"to":344,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":346,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":346,"x":140,"y":-560,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Descent, Onyx Corridor","descriptions":["The smooth onyx of the walls is disrupted here, with each wall carved in its own intricate, raised pattern.  The shallow illumination flowing from the southeast casts soft shadows from the raised features."],"exits":[{"to":345,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":347,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":347,"x":120,"y":-580,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Descent, Hall of the Flesh","descriptions":["Diffused light from the northwest casts a dull glow against the smooth surface of the onyx walls.  The walls feel cold to the touch and no seams mar their perfect symmetry."],"exits":[{"to":346,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":324,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":348,"x":200,"y":-480,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Descent, Entry Hall","descriptions":["The exquisite white marble floors are veined with swirls of verdant green forming the shape of a triple-tined claw pointing northward to the worship halls.  A great black crystal archway leads south, back to the clergy's quarters."],"exits":[{"to":343,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":349,"exit":"go","move":"go crystal archway"}]},
  {"id":349,"x":200,"y":-460,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Dark Hallway","descriptions":["Vaulting high to the ceiling, a black crystalline archway opens a narrow corridor to the north.  A discordant choral chant echoes against the dark stone enclosure, carrying from far away."],"exits":[{"to":350,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":366,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":364,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":348,"exit":"go","move":"go crystal archway"}]},
  {"id":350,"x":220,"y":-460,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Dark Hallway","descriptions":["A stale, coppery stench fills the dark stone corridor.  Rust-colored stains, looking suspiciously like blood, mar the pale ash door in the southern wall."],"exits":[{"to":351,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":349,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":376,"exit":"go","move":"go ash door"}]},
  {"id":351,"x":240,"y":-460,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Dark Hallway","descriptions":["Shadows drape the northeastern corner like lingering specters, unwavering in the feeble glare of makeshift torches affixed to rusty iron sconces in the walls."],"exits":[{"to":352,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":350,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":377,"exit":"go","move":"go silverwillow door"}]},
  {"id":352,"x":240,"y":-440,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Dark Hallway","descriptions":["A flickering torch in the eastern wall casts a feeble glow down the dark stone corridor, barely forcing the shadows to abate."],"exits":[{"to":351,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":353,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":378,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"}]},
  {"id":353,"x":240,"y":-400,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Dark Hallway","descriptions":["Shards of clear crystal cover the dark stone ground, possibly relics fashioned by the absent inhabitants of the temple many years before.  Movement through the hallway has caused some of these shards to clump oddly against a black granite pedestal, as if protecting it."],"exits":[{"to":352,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":354,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":369,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":354,"x":240,"y":-360,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Dark Hallway","descriptions":["The overwhelming stench of decay fills the dank corridor, emanating from a rotting alder door in the north wall.  Thin patches of unidentifiable mold mark random trails on the cold damp walls, almost like sinister handprints left by an unearthly child."],"exits":[{"to":353,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":355,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":380,"exit":"go","move":"go alder door"}]},
  {"id":355,"x":240,"y":-340,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Dark Hallway","descriptions":["The stone corridor curves haphazardly, with jagged shards of dark grey stone jutting out of the southeastern corner.  An empty doorway with shattered remnants of wood hanging off it gapes open in the northwestern wall."],"exits":[{"to":354,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":356,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":379,"exit":"go","move":"go doorway"}]},
  {"id":356,"x":220,"y":-340,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Dark Hallway","descriptions":["Ripped grey cotton tapestries drape the dark stone of the southern wall, once offering reverence to some now-unrecognizable deity."],"exits":[{"to":355,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":357,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":496,"exit":"go","move":"go pine door"}]},
  {"id":357,"x":200,"y":-340,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Dark Hallway","descriptions":["Dark grey stone walls and cold basalt floors stretch far beyond sight through the dimly lit corridors that branch from this central nexus.  Two dilapidated pine doors flank the southern passage."],"exits":[{"to":368,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":356,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":365,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":358,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":386,"exit":"go","move":"go pine door"}]},
  {"id":358,"x":180,"y":-340,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Dark Hallway","descriptions":["Barely attached to its rusted iron hinges, a battered pine door hangs crookedly from the northern wall.  Scraps of rotting cloth lie strewn about the floor, perhaps serving as nightly shelter for the errant rat or two, as evidenced by trails of dried droppings."],"exits":[{"to":357,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":359,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":371,"exit":"go","move":"go pine door"}]},
  {"id":359,"x":160,"y":-340,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Dark Hallway","descriptions":["The curving corridor seems crude and haphazard, shards of jagged stone sticking out from the walls.  This temple was obviously constructed in haste, with an eye toward functionality rather than beauty."],"exits":[{"to":360,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":358,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":372,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden archway"}]},
  {"id":360,"x":160,"y":-360,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Dark Hallway","descriptions":["A scarred alder door in the eastern wall bears several heavy gashes, perhaps the result of some past conflict.  Empty cobwebs hang forlornly from the narrow corners of the stone ceiling."],"exits":[{"to":361,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":359,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":381,"exit":"go","move":"go alder door"}]},
  {"id":361,"x":160,"y":-400,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Dark Hallway","descriptions":["The chill air is dank and sour, carrying the stenches of decay, dried blood, and stale dust.  The corridor branches to the east, wending further into the forgotten temple."],"exits":[{"to":362,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":370,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":360,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":362,"x":160,"y":-440,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Dark Hallway","descriptions":["Shattered chips of mahogany lie scattered over the cold stone floor before an empty doorway in the eastern wall.  A remnant of ripped cloth hangs from the door's smashed iron hinge."],"exits":[{"to":363,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":361,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":374,"exit":"go","move":"go doorway"}]},
  {"id":363,"x":160,"y":-460,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Dark Hallway","descriptions":["A rusted iron rack hangs in the northwestern corner, bearing several implements of war.  An omnipresent, distant chanting rises and falls in your ears, carrying eerily through the corridor."],"exits":[{"to":364,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":362,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":375,"exit":"go","move":"go silverwillow door"}]},
  {"id":364,"x":180,"y":-460,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Dark Hallway","descriptions":["Across from a cracked ash door, an empty rusted iron sconce juts out of the northern wall.  The shadows here drape heavily, choking what feeble light flickers from down the hallway."],"exits":[{"to":349,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":363,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":387,"exit":"go","move":"go ash door"}]},
  {"id":365,"x":200,"y":-320,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Sunken Vestibule","descriptions":["Leaning walls inlaid with panes of polished black onyx enclose this sunken, icy vestibule that is lit by sparkles of dark gold winking fleetingly like teasing ghosts.  Odd sounds echo back and forth, reminiscent of a choir bustling through rehearsal."],"exits":[{"to":357,"exit":"north","move":"north"}]},
  {"id":366,"x":200,"y":-440,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Prison Hallway","descriptions":["The uneven dark stone walls bear strange, ancient etchings that depict gruesome scenes of war.  Dark colors outlining some of the carvings have permanently leached into the porous stone."],"exits":[{"to":349,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":367,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":385,"exit":"go","move":"go cell door"}]},
  {"id":367,"x":200,"y":-400,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Prison Hallway","descriptions":["The four hallways converge here, centered around a massive grid of wrought iron that stretches out over a shadow-draped pit sunk deep into the ground.  A thick noxious order of decay curls up from the depths of this repugnant cage."],"exits":[{"to":366,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":369,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":368,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":370,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":408,"exit":"go","move":"go steel door"},{"to":409,"exit":"go","move":"go iron door"}]},
  {"id":368,"x":200,"y":-360,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Prison Hallway","descriptions":["The dark stone floor is uncluttered and swept clean of dust and debris, leaving the impression that something has been here recently.  In spite of the lack of rubble, the air smells dank, with a hint of decay."],"exits":[{"to":367,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":357,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":383,"exit":"go","move":"go cell door"}]},
  {"id":369,"x":220,"y":-400,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Prison Hallway","descriptions":["An empty sconce hangs askew from one wall, the area around it scorched black.  Clumps of cobwebs, heavy with dust, enshroud the tarnished brass."],"exits":[{"to":353,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":367,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":382,"exit":"go","move":"go cell door"}]},
  {"id":370,"x":180,"y":-400,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Prison Hallway","descriptions":["Deep gouge marks mar the rough stone floor, as if something with very large claws was dragged in an unwilling manner through the passage.  Moisture has collected in some of the indentations, causing the floor to be slick in spots."],"exits":[{"to":367,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":361,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":384,"exit":"go","move":"go cell door"}]},
  {"id":371,"x":180,"y":-320,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Monks' Quarters","descriptions":["Ten cedar-framed cots, with tattered blankets scattered haphazardly on each, line the walls of this moderate-sized room.  The harsh stone walls bear no adornment."],"exits":[{"to":358,"exit":"go","move":"go pine door"}]},
  {"id":372,"x":160,"y":-320,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Baths","descriptions":["The small chamber is dimly lit by flickering torches in the rough stone walls.  The feeble light reflects soft wavering images off the glassy black waters of a large bathing pool."],"exits":[{"to":373,"exit":"go","move":"go black pool"},{"to":359,"exit":"go","move":"go wooden archway"}]},
  {"id":373,"x":140,"y":-320,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Obsidian Pool","descriptions":["Dimly flickering torchlight glimmers off the rippling, glassy black waters of the pool.  The water is icy, chilling you to the bone."],"exits":[{"to":372,"exit":"go","move":"go pool's edge"}]},
  {"id":374,"x":140,"y":-440,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Theurgists' Chamber","descriptions":["Mangled black cotton tapestries drape the walls, twitching slightly with the subtle currents of air caused by your presence.  Three mahogany beds are pushed tightly up against the walls."],"exits":[{"to":362,"exit":"go","move":"go doorway"}]},
  {"id":375,"x":140,"y":-460,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Magical Workshop","descriptions":["The heavy odors of ash and sulfur permeate this claustrophobic stone enclosure.  Bookcases laden with scrolls and volumes line the walls, everything badly charred from some recent blaze.  Several tables and counters are strewn with all sorts of odd equipment."],"exits":[{"to":363,"exit":"go","move":"go silverwillow door"}]},
  {"id":376,"x":220,"y":-480,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Hierophant's Chamber","descriptions":["An intricate mosaic of gleaming gemstone tiles graces the otherwise gloomy stone wall above an ancient silverwillow bed.  Stained linens, shredded and tattered in some past struggle, hang off the bed and onto the cold stone floor."],"exits":[{"to":350,"exit":"go","move":"go ash door"}]},
  {"id":377,"x":260,"y":-460,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Library","descriptions":["Fallen bookshelves lie strewn about the dark stone ground, burnt and razed of all they may have held.  It appears that someone -- or something -- did not want what was in this room to be found.  A single page ripped from an unknown tome seems to have been spared, left lying on a cracked cedar desk."],"exits":[{"to":351,"exit":"go","move":"go silverwillow door"}]},
  {"id":378,"x":260,"y":-440,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Theurgists' Chamber","descriptions":["Oddly centered in the middle of the room is a rickety oak bookcase.  Dark cotton tapestries, their colored patterns faded, hang above three identical mahogany beds pushed up flush against the walls."],"exits":[{"to":352,"exit":"go","move":"go mahogany door"}]},
  {"id":379,"x":240,"y":-320,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Storage Closet","descriptions":["Empty boxes and crates are stacked in an orderly fashion, rising up to the dark stone ceiling.  A single cask lies splintered on the ground, its contents long since emptied."],"exits":[{"to":355,"exit":"go","move":"go doorway"}]},
  {"id":380,"x":260,"y":-360,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Priests' Quarters","descriptions":["Six large willow-framed cots are arranged neatly around the small chamber.  The walls and floors are barren, except for a single cedar cabinet in one corner."],"exits":[{"to":354,"exit":"go","move":"go alder door"}]},
  {"id":381,"x":140,"y":-360,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Priests' Quarters","descriptions":["Six large willow-framed cots are arranged neatly around the small chamber.  The walls and floors are barren, except for a single cedar cabinet in one corner."],"exits":[{"to":360,"exit":"go","move":"go alder door"}]},
  {"id":382,"x":220,"y":-380,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Dank Cell","descriptions":["A shattered skeleton lies in one corner, half of its skull split off and lying nearby.  It is safe to surmise that life has not graced this dank cell for some time, for unbroken cobwebs hang everywhere, their occupants busily spinning undisturbed homes."],"exits":[{"to":369,"exit":"go","move":"go cell door"}]},
  {"id":383,"x":180,"y":-360,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Dank Cell","descriptions":["Iron shackles hang from the cold stone walls, flecked with strange substances and rust.  A foul coppery stench hangs in the air, punctuated with sharp wafts of decay."],"exits":[{"to":368,"exit":"go","move":"go cell door"}]},
  {"id":384,"x":180,"y":-420,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Dank Cell","descriptions":["This large cell, built to hold thirty prisoners or more, now lies abandoned.  Only the chalkmarks on the walls and the gouges in the floor leading up to the cell door give evidence of victims' passing."],"exits":[{"to":370,"exit":"go","move":"go cell door"}]},
  {"id":385,"x":220,"y":-440,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Dank Cell","descriptions":["This desolate cell of rough granite bears the marks of heavy use -- the floor is spattered with dried blood.  Heavy hash marks, perhaps depicting days of captivity, mar one wall."],"exits":[{"to":366,"exit":"go","move":"go cell door"}]},
  {"id":386,"x":220,"y":-320,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Acolytes' Quarters","descriptions":["Smashed cots lie in disarray on the ground, a splintered and torn mess of wood and canvas.  Thick brown stains are prevalent throughout the wreckage, making it easy to imagine the slaughter that once occurred here.","The room is rather large, but packed tightly with twenty cedar-framed cots with the sparest coarse linens.  The pattern is orderly and symmetrical -- artificial.  The stale scent of dust clings to the back of your throat."],"exits":[{"to":357,"exit":"go","move":"go pine door"}]},
  {"id":387,"x":180,"y":-480,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Hierophant's Chamber","descriptions":["An ancient silverwillow bed swathed in shredded silk linens sets against the southern wall.  A rich mahogany armoire inlaid with silver filigree stands nearby, flanked by an ornate blued-steel cloak rack."],"exits":[{"to":307,"exit":"go","move":"script armoire"},{"to":364,"exit":"go","move":"go ash door"}]},
  {"id":388,"x":-380,"y":-540,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor, Nightshade Tangle","descriptions":["Barren of leaves, wretched trees loom up from the tall grass looking a great deal like upturned claws.  A somber mist perpetually hangs in the air, dampening your lungs with its weight.","Irregular patches of tall grass and squat shrubs lie beneath a sinuous blanket of dark purple mist.  The twisted shadow of an occasional barren tree looms in the foggy distance.","Sinuous tendrils of dark purple mist swim through the air, entangling themselves in the deformed limbs of barren trees like ethereal serpents.  The dusky scent of nightshade carries over the moor.","Sharp shadows cut through the landscape, accenting the twisted silhouettes of the grotesquely haggard trees while concealing the hazards that lie hidden within the patches of tall grass.","Swaths of dark mist drape the moor in layers of shadow, concealing the source of a malignant rustling that waits in nearby tangles of nightshade.","Tall grasses sway under the ebb and flow of the dark purple mists, kissing the verdant blades with icy dew.  Patches of colorful nightshade bloom amidst the grasses, a beautiful yet deadly addition to this dark, wild garden.","Tendrils of blooming nightshade climb high through the dark mists into the vacant claw-like trees, appearing to give the deceased husks some semblance of life, however perverted.","The dark mists cast a bluish-lavender pall through the air.  The motion of every shadow is magnified, twitching in wait just beyond your field of vision.","The dusky scent of nightshade seems to manifest visually as the rolling, dark mists that are omnipresent over the wild moor.  The grasses waver in a lilting motion, enchanted by the intoxicating aroma.","The soft mist makes everything seem muted and far away, disconnected and tinged with the illusion of a dream world."],"exits":[{"to":400,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":389,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":281,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":389,"x":-360,"y":-520,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor, Nightshade Tangle","descriptions":["Barren of leaves, wretched trees loom up from the tall grass looking a great deal like upturned claws.  A somber mist perpetually hangs in the air, dampening your lungs with its weight.","Irregular patches of tall grass and squat shrubs lie beneath a sinuous blanket of dark purple mist.  The twisted shadow of an occasional barren tree looms in the foggy distance.","Sinuous tendrils of dark purple mist swim through the air, entangling themselves in the deformed limbs of barren trees like ethereal serpents.  The dusky scent of nightshade carries over the moor.","Sharp shadows cut through the landscape, accenting the twisted silhouettes of the grotesquely haggard trees while concealing the hazards that lie hidden within the patches of tall grass.","Swaths of dark mist drape the moor in layers of shadow, concealing the source of a malignant rustling that waits in nearby tangles of nightshade.","Tall grasses sway under the ebb and flow of the dark purple mists, kissing the verdant blades with icy dew.  Patches of colorful nightshade bloom amidst the grasses, a beautiful yet deadly addition to this dark, wild garden.","Tendrils of blooming nightshade climb high through the dark mists into the vacant claw-like trees, appearing to give the deceased husks some semblance of life, however perverted.","The dark mists cast a bluish-lavender pall through the air.  The motion of every shadow is magnified, twitching in wait just beyond your field of vision.","The dusky scent of nightshade seems to manifest visually as the rolling, dark mists that are omnipresent over the wild moor.  The grasses waver in a lilting motion, enchanted by the intoxicating aroma.","The soft mist makes everything seem muted and far away, disconnected and tinged with the illusion of a dream world."],"exits":[{"to":390,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":388,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":390,"x":-340,"y":-500,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor, Nightshade Tangle","descriptions":["Barren of leaves, wretched trees loom up from the tall grass looking a great deal like upturned claws.  A somber mist perpetually hangs in the air, dampening your lungs with its weight.","Irregular patches of tall grass and squat shrubs lie beneath a sinuous blanket of dark purple mist.  The twisted shadow of an occasional barren tree looms in the foggy distance.","Sinuous tendrils of dark purple mist swim through the air, entangling themselves in the deformed limbs of barren trees like ethereal serpents.  The dusky scent of nightshade carries over the moor.","Sharp shadows cut through the landscape, accenting the twisted silhouettes of the grotesquely haggard trees while concealing the hazards that lie hidden within the patches of tall grass.","Swaths of dark mist drape the moor in layers of shadow, concealing the source of a malignant rustling that waits in nearby tangles of nightshade.","Tall grasses sway under the ebb and flow of the dark purple mists, kissing the verdant blades with icy dew.  Patches of colorful nightshade bloom amidst the grasses, a beautiful yet deadly addition to this dark, wild garden.","Tendrils of blooming nightshade climb high through the dark mists into the vacant claw-like trees, appearing to give the deceased husks some semblance of life, however perverted.","The dark mists cast a bluish-lavender pall through the air.  The motion of every shadow is magnified, twitching in wait just beyond your field of vision.","The dusky scent of nightshade seems to manifest visually as the rolling, dark mists that are omnipresent over the wild moor.  The grasses waver in a lilting motion, enchanted by the intoxicating aroma.","The soft mist makes everything seem muted and far away, disconnected and tinged with the illusion of a dream world."],"exits":[{"to":451,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":391,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":389,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":391,"x":-360,"y":-480,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor, Nightshade Tangle","descriptions":["Barren of leaves, wretched trees loom up from the tall grass looking a great deal like upturned claws.  A somber mist perpetually hangs in the air, dampening your lungs with its weight.","Irregular patches of tall grass and squat shrubs lie beneath a sinuous blanket of dark purple mist.  The twisted shadow of an occasional barren tree looms in the foggy distance.","Sinuous tendrils of dark purple mist swim through the air, entangling themselves in the deformed limbs of barren trees like ethereal serpents.  The dusky scent of nightshade carries over the moor.","Sharp shadows cut through the landscape, accenting the twisted silhouettes of the grotesquely haggard trees while concealing the hazards that lie hidden within the patches of tall grass.","Swaths of dark mist drape the moor in layers of shadow, concealing the source of a malignant rustling that waits in nearby tangles of nightshade.","Tall grasses sway under the ebb and flow of the dark purple mists, kissing the verdant blades with icy dew.  Patches of colorful nightshade bloom amidst the grasses, a beautiful yet deadly addition to this dark, wild garden.","Tendrils of blooming nightshade climb high through the dark mists into the vacant claw-like trees, appearing to give the deceased husks some semblance of life, however perverted.","The dark mists cast a bluish-lavender pall through the air.  The motion of every shadow is magnified, twitching in wait just beyond your field of vision.","The dusky scent of nightshade seems to manifest visually as the rolling, dark mists that are omnipresent over the wild moor.  The grasses waver in a lilting motion, enchanted by the intoxicating aroma.","The soft mist makes everything seem muted and far away, disconnected and tinged with the illusion of a dream world."],"exits":[{"to":390,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":392,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":461,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
