  {"id":393,"x":-280,"y":-500,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor, Nightshade Tangle","descriptions":["Barren of leaves, wretched trees loom up from the tall grass looking a great deal like upturned claws.  A somber mist perpetually hangs in the air, dampening your lungs with its weight.","Irregular patches of tall grass and squat shrubs lie beneath a sinuous blanket of dark purple mist.  The twisted shadow of an occasional barren tree looms in the foggy distance.","Sinuous tendrils of dark purple mist swim through the air, entangling themselves in the deformed limbs of barren trees like ethereal serpents.  The dusky scent of nightshade carries over the moor.","Sharp shadows cut through the landscape, accenting the twisted silhouettes of the grotesquely haggard trees while concealing the hazards that lie hidden within the patches of tall grass.","Swaths of dark mist drape the moor in layers of shadow, concealing the source of a malignant rustling that waits in nearby tangles of nightshade.","Tall grasses sway under the ebb and flow of the dark purple mists, kissing the verdant blades with icy dew.  Patches of colorful nightshade bloom amidst the grasses, a beautiful yet deadly addition to this dark, wild garden.","Tendrils of blooming nightshade climb high through the dark mists into the vacant claw-like trees, appearing to give the deceased husks some semblance of life, however perverted.","The dark mists cast a bluish-lavender pall through the air.  The motion of every shadow is magnified, twitching in wait just beyond your field of vision.","The dusky scent of nightshade seems to manifest visually as the rolling, dark mists that are omnipresent over the wild moor.  The grasses waver in a lilting motion, enchanted by the intoxicating aroma.","The soft mist makes everything seem muted and far away, disconnected and tinged with the illusion of a dream world."],"exits":[{"to":453,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":394,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":392,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":394,"x":-260,"y":-480,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor, Nightshade Tangle","descriptions":["Barren of leaves, wretched trees loom up from the tall grass looking a great deal like upturned claws.  A somber mist perpetually hangs in the air, dampening your lungs with its weight.","Irregular patches of tall grass and squat shrubs lie beneath a sinuous blanket of dark purple mist.  The twisted shadow of an occasional barren tree looms in the foggy distance.","Sinuous tendrils of dark purple mist swim through the air, entangling themselves in the deformed limbs of barren trees like ethereal serpents.  The dusky scent of nightshade carries over the moor.","Sharp shadows cut through the landscape, accenting the twisted silhouettes of the grotesquely haggard trees while concealing the hazards that lie hidden within the patches of tall grass.","Swaths of dark mist drape the moor in layers of shadow, concealing the source of a malignant rustling that waits in nearby tangles of nightshade.","Tall grasses sway under the ebb and flow of the dark purple mists, kissing the verdant blades with icy dew.  Patches of colorful nightshade bloom amidst the grasses, a beautiful yet deadly addition to this dark, wild garden.","Tendrils of blooming nightshade climb high through the dark mists into the vacant claw-like trees, appearing to give the deceased husks some semblance of life, however perverted.","The dark mists cast a bluish-lavender pall through the air.  The motion of every shadow is magnified, twitching in wait just beyond your field of vision.","The dusky scent of nightshade seems to manifest visually as the rolling, dark mists that are omnipresent over the wild moor.  The grasses waver in a lilting motion, enchanted by the intoxicating aroma.","The soft mist makes everything seem muted and far away, disconnected and tinged with the illusion of a dream world."],"exits":[{"to":297,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":395,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":393,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
