  {"id":401,"x":-320,"y":-580,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor, Nightshade Tangle","descriptions":["Barren of leaves, wretched trees loom up from the tall grass looking a great deal like upturned claws.  A somber mist perpetually hangs in the air, dampening your lungs with its weight.","Irregular patches of tall grass and squat shrubs lie beneath a sinuous blanket of dark purple mist.  The twisted shadow of an occasional barren tree looms in the foggy distance.","Sinuous tendrils of dark purple mist swim through the air, entangling themselves in the deformed limbs of barren trees like ethereal serpents.  The dusky scent of nightshade carries over the moor.","Sharp shadows cut through the landscape, accenting the twisted silhouettes of the grotesquely haggard trees while concealing the hazards that lie hidden within the patches of tall grass.","Swaths of dark mist drape the moor in layers of shadow, concealing the source of a malignant rustling that waits in nearby tangles of nightshade.","Tall grasses sway under the ebb and flow of the dark purple mists, kissing the verdant blades with icy dew.  Patches of colorful nightshade bloom amidst the grasses, a beautiful yet deadly addition to this dark, wild garden.","Tendrils of blooming nightshade climb high through the dark mists into the vacant claw-like trees, appearing to give the deceased husks some semblance of life, however perverted.","The dark mists cast a bluish-lavender pall through the air.  The motion of every shadow is magnified, twitching in wait just beyond your field of vision.","The dusky scent of nightshade seems to manifest visually as the rolling, dark mists that are omnipresent over the wild moor.  The grasses waver in a lilting motion, enchanted by the intoxicating aroma.","The soft mist makes everything seem muted and far away, disconnected and tinged with the illusion of a dream world."],"exits":[{"to":460,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":448,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":400,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":390,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":402,"x":-60,"y":-600,"z":0,"title":"Mausoleum, Receiving Chamber","descriptions":["A gleaming marble tiled hallway stretches into the bowels of the mausoleum, flanked by great pillars of granite that support the structure.  Cobwebs drape delicately over tables of empty brass urns.  A pair of great obsidian doors in the southern edge of the hall form the exit from the mausoleum."],"exits":[{"to":403,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":316,"exit":"go","move":"go obsidian doors"}]},
  {"id":403,"x":-60,"y":-620,"z":0,"title":"Mausoleum, Hallway","descriptions":["The great open space of the hall seems muted and claustrophobic, clenched in the presence of something intangible.  Tapestries cascade down from the vaulted ceiling along either side of the hallway, wavering like dancing ghosts in the stale, musty air.  Through the dim light, a collection of marble biers is visible, lining the northern end of the hallway."],"exits":[{"to":404,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":402,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":405,"exit":"go","move":"go white tapestry"},{"to":406,"exit":"go","move":"go black tapestry"}]},
  {"id":404,"x":-60,"y":-640,"z":0,"title":"Mausoleum, Biers","descriptions":["Ten great marble biers are arranged in a fanned semi-circle at the northern end of the hallway.  Streaming down from a small hole in the ceiling, a shaft of bright golden sunlight falls within their midst.  A steel-reinforced ebony coffin rests on one of the marble biers.  Several chains hang loosely down along the sides of the bier.  Cascading down the eastern wall, a blood red tapestry adds a splash of rich color to the otherwise austere environment.","Ten great marble biers are arranged in a fanned semi-circle at the northern end of the hallway.  Streaming down from a small hole in the ceiling, a shaft of bright golden sunlight falls within their midst.  A steel-reinforced ebony coffin hangs in the air, suspended by several heavy chains above the biers.  Cascading down the eastern wall, a blood red tapestry adds a splash of rich color to the otherwise austere environment.","Ten great marble biers are arranged in a fanned semi-circle at the northern end of the hallway.  Streaming down from a small hole in the ceiling, a shaft of pale silver starlight falls within their midst.  A steel-reinforced ebony coffin rests on one of the marble biers.  Several chains hang loosely down along the sides of the bier.  Cascading down the eastern wall, a blood red tapestry adds a splash of rich color to the otherwise austere environment.  ","Ten great marble biers are arranged in a fanned semi-circle at the northern end of the hallway.  Streaming down from a small hole in the ceiling, a shaft of pale silver starlight falls within their midst.  A steel-reinforced ebony coffin hangs in the air, suspended by several heavy chains above the biers.  Cascading down the eastern wall, a blood red tapestry adds a splash of rich color to the otherwise austere environment.  "],"exits":[{"to":403,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":407,"exit":"go","move":"go ebony coffin","hidden":true},{"to":365,"exit":"none","move":"script infusionentry"}]},
  {"id":405,"x":-80,"y":-640,"z":0,"title":"Mausoleum, Alcove","descriptions":["An aura of warm light illuminates the alcove, emanating from dozens of candles held within tall silver sconces mounted on the marble floor.  A large wooden wheel has been affixed to the north wall, while rugged steel chains run up into some sort of pulley mechanism on the rafters.  A heavy woven rope dangles down from above, fastened to the same contraption."],"exits":[{"to":403,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}],"aliases":["White Tapestry"]},
  {"id":406,"x":-40,"y":-640,"z":0,"title":"Mausoleum, Alcove","descriptions":["Inky black shadows saturate the alcove like a heavy fog, making it hard to discern anything but faint outlines and shapes.  A strange wheel nestles up against the north wall, entangled in a thick netting of cobwebs.  A snake-like rope dangles down from the darkness above."],"exits":[{"to":403,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"aliases":["Black Tapestry"]},
  {"id":407,"x":200,"y":-300,"z":0,"title":"Mausoleum, Inside Coffin","descriptions":["Pure white satin padding makes lying in this claustrophobic box a bit more inviting than you would otherwise imagine.  A shaft of bright golden sunlight streams through a small hole in the ceiling directly above the coffin, striking you squarely in the chest.","Pure white satin padding makes lying in this claustrophobic box a bit more inviting than you would otherwise imagine.  A shaft of pale silver starlight streams through a small hole in the ceiling directly above the coffin, striking you squarely in the chest.  "],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":408,"x":220,"y":-420,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Guard's Chamber","descriptions":["A massive weapons rack lies pushed up against the north wall, piled high with pole-arm weapons.  A great iron bell hangs from the ceiling, an alarm in times of need.  A spare stick cot has been erected off in the corner."],"exits":[{"to":367,"exit":"go","move":"go steel door"}]},
  {"id":409,"x":180,"y":-380,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Seed, Guard's Chamber","descriptions":["Shelves full of swords, maces, and other small weapons cover the dark stone walls.  A spare stick cot lies in an out-of-the way corner, surrounded by racks of plate and chain armor."],"exits":[{"to":367,"exit":"go","move":"go iron door"}]},
  {"id":410,"x":500,"y":-520,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Nether, Maelshyve's Remnant","descriptions":["The coiling helix of fused bone ends here, dropping off into the abyss.  Cradled in the clawlike comfort of the path's edge is a great black shell, cracked open like an egg.  From within, an endless river of midnight-blue sludge pours out, streaming into the endless darkness below.","Cradled in the clawlike comfort of the path's edge is a great black shell, cracked open like an egg.  From within, an endless river of midnight-blue sludge pours out, streaming into the endless darkness below."],"exits":[{"to":411,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":682,"exit":"go","move":"go midnight-blue sludge"}]},
  {"id":411,"x":480,"y":-500,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["Blackness encroaches like a hungry cloud, choking visibility.  What light is not consumed is candid in its revelations.  Twisted, chewed, and mangled bones are loosely arranged to form a path, gathered from every sort of creature and fused in several creative ways.  Discernible shapes -- skulls, claws, ribs and hands -- protrude from unidentifiable appendages."],"exits":[{"to":410,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":412,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":412,"x":460,"y":-500,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["From this vantage more of the bone construct can be viewed.  Arising from the abyss like a giant coiled adder, and held aloft by no discernible force, it swirls high above you in the dark shadows.  A heavy silence is broken by the crunch of bone fragments underfoot."],"exits":[{"to":411,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":413,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":413,"x":440,"y":-500,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["The path shifts like a tiny vessel in a stormy sea, threatening to toss all aboard into the deadly inkiness keeping it afloat.  A skull near the edge of the path lays with its mouth open and sockets empty, grinning smugly and perhaps waiting to be entertained by a dramatic fall."],"exits":[{"to":412,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":414,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":414,"x":400,"y":-500,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["The bones making up the path grow alternately smooth and jagged, some jutting outward like angry brambles, while others are deceptively unblemished.  The smallest bones are thin and brittle, snapping loudly in the darkness when broken."],"exits":[{"to":413,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":415,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":415,"x":380,"y":-500,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["This bone pathway resonates with any application of pressure, emitting crunches and creaks as it sways above a dark emptiness so complete that there are no echoes.  Occasionally amidst the cacophony, something resembling a plaintive cry rises up, a haunting wail of sound that thuds dully against the shifting bones."],"exits":[{"to":414,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":416,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":416,"x":360,"y":-520,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["Darkness enshrouds this gruesome spiral like a heinous mother nurturing its demon child.  Occasional wind currents cause the huge construct to sway ominously, promising death if it collapses and plummets into the empty abyss below."],"exits":[{"to":415,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":417,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":417,"x":340,"y":-540,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["The bones making up the path intertwine in a jumbled matrix, coiling like dry white rope.  Arms and legs bend at odd and painful angles, locking together to form a treacherous but passable roadway.  Below, only blackness can be seen."],"exits":[{"to":418,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":416,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":418,"x":340,"y":-580,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["From somewhere high above, a faint light filters down through the construct.  This feeble illumination shines dully through a hole in one particular skull, causing the empty eye sockets to cast bizarre shadows onto the pathway."],"exits":[{"to":419,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":417,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":419,"x":340,"y":-620,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["It almost appears that the skeletons lining the pathway have been consumed by the heinous spiral.  Only the skulls remain, lining the pathway like boulders cast along the side of a hellish road.  Vacant eye sockets stare blindly at one another with gaping jaws frozen open -- locked forever in an endless silent scream."],"exits":[{"to":420,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":418,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":420,"x":360,"y":-640,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["The collection of bones here is sparse, creating large holes where pieces have broken off.  Several of the broken fragments swing precariously within the unobstructed gaps, clacking ghoulishly against each other and creating a disturbing melody that echoes throughout the darkness."],"exits":[{"to":421,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":419,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":421,"x":380,"y":-660,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["An odd assortment of small bones has been fused curiously together, in a manner that causes the jagged edges to partially obstruct the pathway and slow passage.  Some of the spiked tips grip pieces of shredded cloth and fur, perhaps giving mute testimony that this strategy has been successful."],"exits":[{"to":422,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":420,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":422,"x":420,"y":-660,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["A lone skeletal hand dangles limply over the edge of the bone structure -- fishing for hope in the darkness, perhaps.  A strange clear liquid drips from its bony fingers, glistening eerily in the scant light."],"exits":[{"to":423,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":421,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":423,"x":460,"y":-660,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["The bone path here forms a concave structure, creating a hollow 'U' shape that provides some adventitious guardrails.  On the outside of the path, the blackness is startlingly mouth-like.  It seems eager to swallow the path, consuming it into nonexistence."],"exits":[{"to":424,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":422,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":424,"x":480,"y":-640,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["Shattered fragments, a sad testament to once living creatures, now cover this vile pathway.  Random piles of these dissimilar bones are littered throughout the area, stacked unevenly to form small rounded towers."],"exits":[{"to":425,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":423,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":425,"x":500,"y":-620,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["The stench of decay hangs heavily over the area, despite the distinct lack of rotting flesh.  Tiny pieces of bone are randomly scattered everywhere, as if the hand of death had thrown them in a macabre game."],"exits":[{"to":426,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":424,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":426,"x":500,"y":-580,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["The bone path is yellowed in places, with grime caked in the numerous nooks and crannies formed by the interlocking vertebrae.  A fatty substance leaks from some of the older bones, soundlessly bleeding into the surrounding hollowness.  In a corner near the edge of the road the bones look gnawed, as if some starving being sought nourishment from the oily substance."],"exits":[{"to":425,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":427,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":427,"x":500,"y":-540,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["The bones of the path groan, shifting slightly in the noxious, breathy wind that courses through the area.  One distorted ribcage has taken on a kite-like appearance, bones caved outward in an effort to catch a passing breeze and fly away from this place."],"exits":[{"to":426,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":428,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":428,"x":480,"y":-520,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["A precarious shelf of bone juts out over the dark abyss.  From this vantage, the faint outline of the macabre pathway can be seen coiling indefinitely into the inky blackness above."],"exits":[{"to":427,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":429,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":429,"x":460,"y":-520,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["The path continues to wind its dangerous spiral, disappearing into the darkness.  A shattered skull, missing an eye and half of its cranium, lies in the center of the path, grinning stupidly."],"exits":[{"to":428,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":430,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":430,"x":420,"y":-520,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["The passageway narrows, forming a treacherous path over the darkness below.  Two nearby skeletons lay at odd angles, their hands locked in each other's grasp.  It seems that even death could not separate the pair."],"exits":[{"to":429,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":431,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":431,"x":380,"y":-520,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["The flesh-stripped bones are broken and fragmented, with sharp jagged edges.  Huge black spiders with oddly distended bellies scramble up and over the shattered pieces, spinning tight webs inside some of the larger hollow shafts."],"exits":[{"to":430,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":432,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":432,"x":360,"y":-540,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["Oddly, fused bones form a strange skeleton resting near the northern section of the path.  It appears that the skeletal remains from several creatures have been gruesomely attached to each other, to create this abominable roadside sentinel."],"exits":[{"to":433,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":431,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":433,"x":360,"y":-600,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["The path twists and turns upwards in a northeasterly direction, hiding calcified bones in the murky darkness.  Occasional sharp cracks jar the stillness, as gravity takes it toll on the brittle skeletal fragments.  The sound echoes down the bone path, galloping like a ghostly caravan racing down a disembodied spine."],"exits":[{"to":434,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":432,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":434,"x":380,"y":-620,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["A large bone, possibly a Gor'Tog fibula, protrudes dangerously from the center of the pathway and threatens to eviscerate unwary passersby.  Skeletons lining both sides of the walkway seem to pay silent tribute to this gruesome obstruction."],"exits":[{"to":435,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":433,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":435,"x":400,"y":-640,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["A partially formed bone golem rises ominously from the pathway, its torso mysteriously imbedded in the ground beneath it.  The creature's deep hollow eye sockets face downwards, their intent unfathomable."],"exits":[{"to":436,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":434,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":436,"x":440,"y":-640,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["The bones near the edge of the path have snapped, their jagged edges jutting outwards, slashing at the darkness.  Occasional drafts waft through the hollow tubes, causing ghostly whispers that echo ominously throughout the area -- a warning perhaps?"],"exits":[{"to":437,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":435,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":437,"x":460,"y":-620,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["The sense of abandonment is palpable.  From this vantage point, much of the bone-path below is visible.  The road seems distant, unreal, as if were more suggestion than reality."],"exits":[{"to":438,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":436,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":438,"x":480,"y":-600,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["Shattered skeletons lay scattered in a multitude of broken piles, teeth torn from skulls and limbs from torsos.  Nebulous shadows coldly envelop the splintered pieces like a heinous spirit devouring a conquered soul."],"exits":[{"to":439,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":437,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":439,"x":480,"y":-580,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["Large areas of the path have completely fallen away, leaving dangerous gaps in the roadway.  Occasional scraps of rotted cloth cling desperately to skeletal remains, adding gruesome splotches of color to the morbid setting."],"exits":[{"to":438,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":440,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":440,"x":460,"y":-560,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["The passageway narrows, becoming tunnel-like -- walls with curving, yellow ivory that is oddly rippled.  Closer inspection reveals the unusual curvatures to be ribs from all manner of creatures.  Many of the bones are splintered and spiked in tight clusters which encroach upon a trespasser's passage."],"exits":[{"to":439,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":441,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":441,"x":440,"y":-540,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["A skeleton dangling from a rotting cape hangs limply over the side of the path, its toes testing imaginary water.  Hollow eye sockets seem to keep watch over the massive spiraling walkway."],"exits":[{"to":440,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":442,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":442,"x":400,"y":-540,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["An impossible convolution of bones awaits above, a massive pathway that coils unendingly into the inky blackness.  Below, the trail continues in a downwards spiral of decaying skeletal morsels."],"exits":[{"to":441,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":443,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":443,"x":380,"y":-560,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["Ghostly tendrils of light filter through the area, casting ominous shadows on the pathway of skeletal fragments.  The ground is scattered with moldy crushed bone that makes sinister noises when walked upon."],"exits":[{"to":444,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":442,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":444,"x":380,"y":-580,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["The path widens here.  Families of skeletons congregate, their interlocked rib cages forming a bizarre guardrail that protects the northeastern edge of the path.  Below, the darkness is fluid, hungrily lapping at the visibility."],"exits":[{"to":445,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":443,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":445,"x":400,"y":-600,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["Dimness cloaks this space and its nightmarish desolation threatens the senses.  Overhead is a giant, twirling mass of bones, suspended in mid-air.  An occasional draft creates eerie clanking sounds as bones rattle against each other."],"exits":[{"to":446,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":444,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":446,"x":420,"y":-620,"z":0,"title":"Abyss, Maelshyve's Ascent","descriptions":["A massive construct of fused bone swirls into the abyss below, held aloft by no tangible force.  It simply floats in the emptiness, like the contorted spine of the World Dragon.  It is clear that this is no remnant of a single beast -- the ground is formed of bones of all shapes and sizes, from all manner of beasts, fused together by some mysterious feat."],"exits":[{"to":445,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":447,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":447,"x":440,"y":-620,"z":0,"title":"Maelshyve's Ascent, Summit","descriptions":["The great helix's upper boundary ends here, a wicked collection of bone spires stabbing blindly into the darkness above.  Held captive amongst them, an empty throne of brilliant blood-red crystal beckons.  Below, the path of bone descends into a seemingly unending spiral into the darkness."],"exits":[{"to":446,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":324,"exit":"go","move":"go throne","hidden":true}]},
  {"id":448,"x":-300,"y":-560,"z":0,"title":"Darkmist Moor, Nightshade Tangle","descriptions":["Barren of leaves, wretched trees loom up from the tall grass looking a great deal like upturned claws.  A somber mist perpetually hangs in the air, dampening your lungs with its weight.","Irregular patches of tall grass and squat shrubs lie beneath a sinuous blanket of dark purple mist.  The twisted shadow of an occasional barren tree looms in the foggy distance.","Sinuous tendrils of dark purple mist swim through the air, entangling themselves in the deformed limbs of barren trees like ethereal serpents.  The dusky scent of nightshade carries over the moor.","Sharp shadows cut through the landscape, accenting the twisted silhouettes of the grotesquely haggard trees while concealing the hazards that lie hidden within the patches of tall grass.","Swaths of dark mist drape the moor in layers of shadow, concealing the source of a malignant rustling that waits in nearby tangles of nightshade.","Tall grasses sway under the ebb and flow of the dark purple mists, kissing the verdant blades with icy dew.  Patches of colorful nightshade bloom amidst the grasses, a beautiful yet deadly addition to this dark, wild garden.","Tendrils of blooming nightshade climb high through the dark mists into the vacant claw-like trees, appearing to give the deceased husks some semblance of life, however perverted.","The dark mists cast a bluish-lavender pall through the air.  The motion of every shadow is magnified, twitching in wait just beyond your field of vision.","The dusky scent of nightshade seems to manifest visually as the rolling, dark mists that are omnipresent over the wild moor.  The grasses waver in a lilting motion, enchanted by the intoxicating aroma.","The soft mist makes everything seem muted and far away, disconnected and tinged with the illusion of a dream world."],"exits":[{"to":281,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":451,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":449,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":401,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
